    <node id="AI System">
      <data key="d0">AI System</data>
      <data key="d1">AISystem</data>
      <data key="d2">AI systems that integrate AI models must comply with regulations when made available for market use.&lt;SEP&gt;An AI System refers to algorithms and technologies designed for deployment affecting individuals, groups, or society, with implications for product safety.&lt;SEP&gt;An AI system refers to the technological implementation involving artificial intelligence that produces outcomes affecting users and society.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI System refers to a technological framework designed to perform tasks typically requiring human intelligence, such as understanding and processing instructions. It embodies sophisticated technological products that integrate artificial intelligence capabilities aimed at making predictions, recommendations, or decisions based on input data. AI Systems can take various forms, including software or hardware, and are characterized by advanced algorithms and data structures that facilitate tasks traditionally associated with human cognitive functions, such as recognition, learning, decision-making, risk assessment, and content generation.

These systems are widely employed across numerous sectors, both civilian and potential military, affecting individuals depending on their applications. The AI System engages in complex processes that may involve creating media content that resembles real people or events. Regulatory frameworks, particularly within the European Union, classify these systems either as safety components or products, imposing stringent compliance with harmonization legislation. Such regulations require conducting exhaustive risk assessments to understand potential impacts on health, safety, and fundamental rights, ensuring continuous oversight by market surveillance authorities, especially for high-risk categories where non-compliance can lead to administrative penalties.

To promote innovation while adhering to these regulations, AI Systems are often tested in controlled environments known as regulatory sandboxes. This setup allows for performance evaluation under supervised conditions, highlighting the importance of transparency regarding the artificial nature of content created by AI Systems, as it can significantly influence public perception.

Furthermore, AI Systems are categorized based on risk levels—high-risk or non-high-risk—and are subject to assessments by regulatory authorities. They play a crucial role in various applications, including the provision of financial services, and require oversight and reporting obligations especially concerning serious incidents. Overall, the development and deployment of AI Systems are governed by regulations that aim to uphold human rights and fundamental freedoms while replicating human cognitive capabilities through advanced artificial intelligence technologies.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-07e8d113bd66975dbb8053a37cc427fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-071372b252509d0e29e64264c0511359&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50cb89ed7d0d818018d373ebefa65267&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83317eda1161cf5d13ef9aa07297c98b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2edb4e37d5b6a1ec68d071ea273b4e52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b235644744fa597c94328afbeaa7e56b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb0291da832d9defa94aaf2262ad3761&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a94885e0b736d24263914e9a9d565900&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f4ac0ccf9bd954306cee6efbfd342416&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b7fd511ed97ef1a87c9783c3425b7d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e78bce1eaa5df9c186492b5e1482218&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad1a115533e7d3b3ced9ea8e2e87b0e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b28a4b325cc05a6cc4897f58ccdf00f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4672fd3df7077626af67d20e46d3fcb4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ad9c740a10a5c1577e578a593bd61fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b89491b02af0a00cbc13f9e8df827a6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d64a2a65aec35f8304efaaee30e0034d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-decd01dd1bf25270eddf9979fe28678a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28daf57045ce50f0bd160cddd41ffc14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ef570a9dfbda3c55d0d5bcc36fd77c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee6d94a5f64203f09d02387acbdb39c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ffa7662f1a996e8ed97ec3caf0ae564&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4acea71d2f59038573b7ec13db4ad10b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5da2f6b1c2fa5619efa26719534e9c35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-599d61ad7be34e2603c3fef13f2ff8dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cb2802f1b508b813d06e58ae27a1f77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-907dfa7ec80255255b81cd50cd6a4494&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-800752b66b6fe0cd70bb0290efc2fbbe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b4348ad8873ef2041aca94abc9297ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f6e14583352886a741ac1d51eada03a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b0c31436f0e7ce27ce5952aa2bf9ae5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1eea61d03ab615ac5f518e77cd220c1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50beca99a2207706ee9f0ad17a4205ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd27f4cf61449e217b2273c0cf67adfa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c9405f93ec3e0ccf6209ed15ef0263f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72cfde8a7c3c94fdf1dc93c4253bec9e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f5fc2b531499a81e154196ee1e86ac6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cc37264ee8f2a814b7b6f98953de48c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e284955c1d36330bd14d117bb417611&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7dbd41da6ea2a77fff5beb18c8e7c896&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8efd21db4fc63a879493cbb376ae904&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8da189e7622be67a80b2e12945a657cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb3519876fdebea487c9995e6d3ae4fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65f69156748df83d9fa179140a3fe2aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4518ca313d8493e277775e1a9267b84d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a64bfb94635a0df2f808b2f8a494bd3e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7d62750f1113d24ac155fcd2b2ef02c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c237e1a0b42db9afb10cc8a045dbb751&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6570d0db42cf764ebb073d69da0137e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cc9a7191827dda78eda5924876e5f7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2ba08954f9ed754c2566e3c59b63ee7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be61089eed18cfaf2703713378c589a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fc29985a43f3bd521b3a1c9eb9ba756&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2612abd3c26dca69a0acec30add3ef15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a350089bbf860c041d514aa2041d9455&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5fb48082255c480535475ddb098366a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-345a8ba89ed0ea3325462384d5e16aaf</data>
