    <node id="Necessary Information">
      <data key="d0">Necessary Information</data>
      <data key="d1">Data</data>
      <data key="d2">Necessary Information encompasses all data and documentation required to demonstrate compliance of AI systems to authorities.&lt;SEP&gt;Necessary information includes all data required by providers to comply with obligations of high-risk AI systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b4329be6d4972c392a3a71593d402998&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fc29985a43f3bd521b3a1c9eb9ba756</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_82.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_25.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750857434</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Compliance">
      <data key="d0">Compliance</data>
      <data key="d1">QualityMeasurement</data>
      <data key="d2">Compliance refers to the comprehensive process of meeting established legal and regulatory requirements concerning high-risk AI systems. This concept encompasses a multitude of actions and practices aimed at ensuring that these systems align with regulatory standards before their introduction to the market. It is essential for AI system providers to adhere to the regulations and guidelines outlined by relevant authorities, as well as to commit to legal and ethical standards during the deployment of AI technologies.

The adherence to compliance involves not only following specific provisions set forth by regulations but also undertaking all necessary measures for proper implementation. It confirms that AI systems operate within legal frameworks across various contexts, focusing on both the deployment and utilization of such technologies to ensure lawful and ethical practices.

In addition, compliance incorporates the necessity of aligning actions with laws that promote accessibility and protection for individuals with disabilities. It is also significant within organizational governance, where it pertains to the Board's adherence to established rules and regulations in its operations.

Overall, compliance serves as a critical metric for measuring the extent to which providers fulfill their obligations as stipulated in regulatory frameworks. It is vital for safeguarding public interests and ensuring that high-risk AI systems function within the legal, ethical, and accessibility standards defined by these regulations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-197c7357cf5fefe6ca4e08f847ff6a75&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c8a6b92fbe8d93eb878957c5ed60aa0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b43f399350f0fc36795c0ce358459d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4329be6d4972c392a3a71593d402998&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fc356102e8bbeed5152b8bb0cda2ff6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee6d94a5f64203f09d02387acbdb39c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99c78ffcf815fa82f05dcb7dc5871e1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ffa7662f1a996e8ed97ec3caf0ae564&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac68c725e087cb7c659f2dd75f0a6e34&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5981afe4b9fb547c64f49e76b1d9c0a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fc29985a43f3bd521b3a1c9eb9ba756&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85d8b1632746db5110bcd9632c1ace58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aab48a13d1c4363ad8edd440c125d4a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e24261c10195e33e965bd7e966c33337&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f89a194b461fcebd5ec31a53d66c4dde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82b1b08be1175d2e6d49ab5a294ef86a</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_82.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_121.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_23.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_117.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_17.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_168.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_96.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_160.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_132.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_81.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_83.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_72.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_25.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_65.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_24.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750863644</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Market">
      <data key="d0">Market</data>
      <data key="d1">Domain</data>
      <data key="d2">The Market refers to the comprehensive commercial environment within the Union where AI systems are developed, offered, and operated. It is regulated and encompasses various aspects including high-risk AI systems, which significantly impact different stakeholders, such as regulatory bodies and deployers. The Market specifically includes the activities of AI providers, especially small and medium-sized enterprises (SMEs) and start-ups, necessitating their compliance with established regulations. Furthermore, the Market serves as an economic space where AI models are distributed or utilized, highlighting its importance in broader systemic implications.&lt;SEP&gt;The market refers to the setting in which the high-risk AI system is placed for use and evaluation.&lt;SEP&gt;The Market represents the economic environment where high-risk AI systems are deployed and influence operational dynamics.&lt;SEP&gt;The market refers to the economic environment where high-risk AI systems are made available for use.&lt;SEP&gt;The market refers to the economic space where goods and services, in this case, high-risk AI systems, are bought and sold.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ba662546e18e6e5f82c3cd1c5b4c3b75&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f5fc2b531499a81e154196ee1e86ac6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7dbd41da6ea2a77fff5beb18c8e7c896&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c4d127e5313d415dd94f6b6761da956&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b8c1122e1044e4445aa96d7fa6d5b6e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fc29985a43f3bd521b3a1c9eb9ba756&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a21678b36bef336bf18e091bdfdb68f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-759ef1bca08a56dec0192e47771d9820&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85fb9638473c0974347ccab540b99b7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a0bef2c1dcc3d7b428c7611732f7ffc</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_82.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_23.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_14.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_177.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_123.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_93.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_24.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_3.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_145.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750861348</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Third Countries">
      <data key="d0">Third Countries</data>
      <data key="d1">LocalityOfUse</data>
      <data key="d2">Third Countries are nations outside of the Union whose AI providers must comply with the Union's regulations to operate in its market.&lt;SEP&gt;Third Countries refer to nations outside the Union that engage in agreements or cooperation with Member States and the Union.&lt;SEP&gt;Third countries are regions outside the Union where data may be transferred, necessitating compliance with protections established by Union law.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6a90a47461f525bba18d74c42ea04f88&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad1a115533e7d3b3ced9ea8e2e87b0e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fc29985a43f3bd521b3a1c9eb9ba756</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_22.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_141.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_82.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750861057</data>
    </node>
    <node id="AI Systems">
      <data key="d0">AI Systems</data>
      <data key="d1">AISystem</data>
      <data key="d2">AI Systems are advanced integrated platforms that leverage artificial intelligence to perform tasks traditionally requiring human intelligence. These sophisticated technological frameworks enhance decision-making across various sectors and play a critical role in regulated environments such as financial institutions, migration management, and law enforcement. As essential components of autonomous data processing and decision-making, AI Systems significantly influence access to public services and benefits, impacting workplaces and educational settings.

Their applications include facial recognition, real-time biometric identification of individuals in public spaces, and utilization in military, defense, and national security contexts. To ensure effective operation, these systems must adhere to stringent regulatory standards related to data processing, user protection, and transparency, particularly in high-risk scenarios where they could potentially manipulate emotionally sensitive content. This regulatory compliance ensures legal certainty and promotes the responsible deployment of AI technologies.

AI Systems are guided by established codes of conduct that promote ethical and trustworthy practices, making them vital in areas such as scientific research, justice administration, and supporting democratic processes. They also manage critical digital infrastructure, overseeing essential services such as water, gas, and electricity supply. The combination of advanced hardware and software equips these systems to handle increasingly complex tasks, especially in sensitive situations like elections.

However, AI Systems face significant challenges, including inherent biases that may negatively affect vulnerable groups and the need for resilience against cyberattacks, which is crucial for reliability and safety. Regulatory oversight mandates that even low-risk AI Systems comply with safety standards when marketed or operated. Furthermore, these systems aim to identify or infer human emotions, a task complicated by cultural variations in emotional expression.

Importantly, AI Systems must also meet accessibility requirements to ensure usability for persons with disabilities, addressing the potential negative impacts of AI technologies on consumers and society. They are categorized based on risk levels, necessitating compliance assessments to ensure responsible usage while mitigating intrinsic operational risks. In summary, AI Systems represent the convergence of innovative technological capabilities and regulatory rigor, aimed at fostering responsible deployment in a landscape marked by various complexities and challenges. They include a variety of technology solutions that may fall into high-risk or non-high-risk categories, each governed by requirements for transparency and adherence to established regulations, including quality management systems mandated by relevant sectoral Union law.&lt;SEP&gt;AI systems are considered components of products or products themselves, and can be classified as high-risk under certain Union harmonisation legislation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3440467bfb3879bf5e30fbb107e28162&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-610573a7c194ad780ed97782200a740c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d6ed86abb2e8f0e12897e923d1e9964&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3f7d41ecd7ed7ec26e62e63255378cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de3f18a6d766d2baa57ae891b9da7741&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28717558f1bb8bd2fd8b9542f8e2a99c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb43ec5a01dc502046ab6ffbe3a25504&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8f21b63428a38759e45ffcb10bac3d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-711f6ce0c9e8f119b1813ffe001673da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7570653f66cb58454b80be2046705a29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43a1516ad8d48077af0d59fc01578f33&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-543cc911c9d837b54a06d5f6ca958b34&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37d88f95110db00bbf8230a2632a2035&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0711090702fd9b1787822998d5deac9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3105f8ed20ed5608a4571fe7b1d8f942&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b31c82fb046f107cbfab945a92431bbc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40f3761e589fb7702938fd4fbbecfdcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ffd8df9d8eb9625dca23bc5f974e025&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40e75ee11aa912f1497b2a91ae655e7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa2298fd83910d35175065de74977bd4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be2e0f993ca9c4e593e5fcbdd8fc03fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d44e4d07784e334a8ded2c1da49b969e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2bccefc944ad0794c75bc69b977c88a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7e1bc352c7c8d3a7ba58b9b1a4f9f37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0271020749ae70ce56cbd607a6f6662a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7859a0c655f74761757b416c3b50bf36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc038db2f25d511bf84cccc9550e10c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33366c5df404f37775ccbf3ec455b578&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8833999c9ef9aa31a007f2e77ffea02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cb1edc11e8b8d0e952b15617a80f379&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e78bce1eaa5df9c186492b5e1482218&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab148daacc5693b15ec462635a5502a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17045c951f494f621b2305960aade53f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8721c261d628c538814f61ffe3cec22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c28a81721b7de3ef4442495cc499b1cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a69b68c9998277692ac6c6341fcdcac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-849f8f0403e6b12fa8a9c24b84c094c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5981afe4b9fb547c64f49e76b1d9c0a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fe270726065b96afec7d35572470b3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ab1f3b6cbb052c58ff3b9fc75a6d7a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c168b1207668ad4ba646371f91bfce09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-907dfa7ec80255255b81cd50cd6a4494&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1ab686ea2085e0bf2cc7ea2cb5eb270&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c76dd7edbc6dcf218d6558d18116d52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1be166c61f466e23c3d8c143f6efd3bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6fa05c618cc92c392c091a0299038b25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7df88d0d68bb9e14cc05c3f581da8399&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a46d97529092ce970fc3194f0ff15f99&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b90abf0636c26d546e9b6724e3224ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff611ee371ea780574e9c16859c31f2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5fb48082255c480535475ddb098366a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b474f9815c7033ca1ad8daff4012eff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-197c7357cf5fefe6ca4e08f847ff6a75&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbcf833252ce65fd6a1d8bd1f5a6efc1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-15eee417af0ebe299ed66be76a0b845a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee1f186f5aed070bc8e6e813caed9967&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-161f3120961644fbdc17c7b09b46e54b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb040a8b4e6e3fa6f26776f560b6591c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0044fdddd0a21caecd46a12639588d98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec6a8294e2a2ad2569029d260c4d7673&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7963b30391bfa3d5e28ecd9a95b61010&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b837dd750c95d041180fa3d735328672&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dead6db59d178a53a4fc03ed67a92e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-064e3e5273a81cd8d9a47da9a3f51240&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77093970e26d1be04734ed16ea88f777&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5765a06abb615496a937c9303e1583cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-397d6e2474c4f45e883f265653f2e715&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bedecbbbba0ded6846e6dc97756b7de5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c14e1756e1d8d71ac3ba07125f122da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41b3ba2302e956849a6be7455071577d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-602b68fe088482c0037845fc0b520c30&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc662d7e26079b23ad5010b8671bfb7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c664ec81872dda212b64d449aa7a2014&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de5a0c7f560be7dcbe4301aed20bcb98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a77d0693b936376b7e0f7b222210759&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-714d9f621f6eee9273625419653b083c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04f1483cdf6b84729e33ebc4a611375b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2315cd7abb88dee440f081de5430a32f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21acb22d994b8f65ea3709a99eb85032&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85605aee8aaac2bf4ad29d80d902148f</data>
