    </node>
    <node id="Union Institutions, Bodies, Offices or Agencies">
      <data key="d0">Union Institutions, Bodies, Offices or Agencies</data>
      <data key="d1">AIDeployer</data>
      <data key="d2">These entities operate under Union law and are subject to oversight by the European Data Protection Supervisor in relation to data protection and AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Union institutions, bodies, offices or agencies must also register their use of high-risk AI systems in the EU database.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-72cfde8a7c3c94fdf1dc93c4253bec9e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f116a95954c59b63ce3149e6283ed8e</data>
