    <node id="TEU">
      <data key="d0">TEU</data>
      <data key="d1">Regulation</data>
      <data key="d2">The TEU (Treaty on European Union) provides the foundational legal framework for the European Union and governs its operations and member states' relations.&lt;SEP&gt;The Treaty on European Union (TEU) forms a foundational legal basis for the EU's function and governance.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-76a2f07f347fedfe788b6636feb212d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-500c97cae442a182ecf77fd6f39000b4</data>
