    </node>
    <node id="TFEU">
      <data key="d0">TFEU</data>
      <data key="d1">LegalBasis</data>
      <data key="d2">The TFEU (Treaty on the Functioning of the European Union) governs the functioning of the EU, including regulations on personal data processing.&lt;SEP&gt;The Treaty on the Functioning of the European Union (TFEU) governs the EU's operational aspects and regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;The Treaty on the Functioning of the European Union (TFEU) provides the legal framework for the enforcement of obligations and penalties stated in the Regulation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-76a2f07f347fedfe788b6636feb212d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae3ab8a3b5c5d0c61e8b99fa718913b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-500c97cae442a182ecf77fd6f39000b4</data>
