      <data key="d0">Article 5(1)</data>
      <data key="d1">Regulation</data>
      <data key="d2">Article 5(1) lays down rules regarding the processing of personal data, including specific provisions for the use of AI systems in judicial cooperation.&lt;SEP&gt;Article 5(1) of the regulations pertains to the use of AI systems and biometric categorization.</data>
