      <data key="d0">Article 26(10)</data>
      <data key="d1">Regulation</data>
      <data key="d2">Article 26(10) addresses the processing of personal data by member states in specific contexts.&lt;SEP&gt;Article 26(10) of the regulation includes stipulations relevant to the cooperation and data handling practices among member states.</data>
