    <node id="Union Financial Services Law">
      <data key="d0">Union Financial Services Law</data>
      <data key="d1">Regulation</data>
      <data key="d2">Union Financial Services Law outlines governance and risk management rules for financial institutions regarding the provision of financial services, particularly in the context of AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Union financial services law sets the regulatory framework that financial institutions must comply with regarding internal governance and deployment of AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Union financial services law outlines the requirements for internal governance and processes that financial institutions must comply with, especially regarding AI.&lt;SEP&gt;Union financial services law establishes requirements for internal governance and processes for financial institutions, impacting how they develop quality management systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Union financial services law sets specific requirements for governance and processes that financial institutions must adhere to in relation to high-risk AI systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-99c78ffcf815fa82f05dcb7dc5871e1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c32bc5fa5cdfa35a393a42535dc4fdfb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-711f6ce0c9e8f119b1813ffe001673da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc662d7e26079b23ad5010b8671bfb7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78dcdae0f5d22df28405d8ae03e038d0</data>
