    </node>
    <node id="Directive 2006/48/EC">
      <data key="d0">Directive 2006/48/EC</data>
      <data key="d1">Regulation</data>
      <data key="d2">A previous directive that set the legal framework for the taking up and pursuit of the business of credit institutions, which was later repealed.&lt;SEP&gt;Directive 2006/48/EC sets rules for access to the business of credit institutions and outlines specific operational guidelines.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6b0054dbaea0e7f90c303fe7d7a824d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18f422febe10e4293aaf989ea5e3d3e8</data>
