      <data key="d0">Specific Tasks</data>
      <data key="d1">QualityMeasurement</data>
      <data key="d2">Specific tasks refer to the responsibilities outlined in the regulation that the European Central Bank must execute regarding the monitoring of credit institutions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-bfa4c0995d224333f53196e26a30156b</data>
