      <data key="d0">Task Delegation</data>
      <data key="d1">Change</data>
      <data key="d2">Task delegation refers to the process of assigning responsibilities from one entity to another, specifically how responsibilities are transferred to the European Central Bank under the regulation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-bfa4c0995d224333f53196e26a30156b</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_158.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750857264</data>
