    <node id="AI System with Subliminal Techniques">
      <data key="d0">AI System with Subliminal Techniques</data>
      <data key="d1">AISystem</data>
      <data key="d2">An AI system that employs subliminal or deceptive techniques to manipulate human behavior, leading to harmful decisions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6ef0a2a22402771842f4d35bbf4be08d</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_5.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750857268</data>
    </node>
    <node id="AI System Exploiting Vulnerabilities">
      <data key="d0">AI System Exploiting Vulnerabilities</data>
      <data key="d1">AISystem</data>
      <data key="d2">An AI system that takes advantage of the vulnerabilities of individuals or groups due to their age, disability, or socio-economic status, potentially causing significant harm.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6ef0a2a22402771842f4d35bbf4be08d</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_5.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750857268</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Social Scoring AI System">
      <data key="d0">Social Scoring AI System</data>
      <data key="d1">AISystem</data>
      <data key="d2">An AI system that evaluates or classifies individuals based on their social behavior or characteristics, potentially leading to unjust treatment.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6ef0a2a22402771842f4d35bbf4be08d</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_5.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750857268</data>
    </node>
    <node id="AI System for Risk Assessment">
      <data key="d0">AI System for Risk Assessment</data>
      <data key="d1">AISystem</data>
      <data key="d2">An AI system intended to assess the risk of individuals committing crimes, based on profiling, which may lead to unfair assessments without verifiable facts.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6ef0a2a22402771842f4d35bbf4be08d</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_5.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750857268</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Significant Harm">
      <data key="d0">Significant Harm</data>
      <data key="d1">Consequence</data>
      <data key="d2">Significant harm refers to the potential negative impact that AI systems can have on individuals or groups, including mental, emotional, or physical consequences.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6ef0a2a22402771842f4d35bbf4be08d</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_5.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750857268</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Deceptive Techniques">
      <data key="d0">Deceptive Techniques</data>
      <data key="d1">AITechnique</data>
      <data key="d2">Deceptive techniques involve strategies used by AI systems to manipulate or mislead individuals, affecting their decision-making unconsciously.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6ef0a2a22402771842f4d35bbf4be08d</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_5.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750857268</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Harmful Decision-Making">
      <data key="d0">Harmful Decision-Making</data>
      <data key="d1">RiskConcept</data>
      <data key="d2">Harmful decision-making refers to the process of making choices that negatively affect individuals or groups, often influenced by AI systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6ef0a2a22402771842f4d35bbf4be08d</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_5.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750857268</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Discriminatory Treatment">
      <data key="d0">Discriminatory Treatment</data>
      <data key="d1">Consequence</data>
      <data key="d2">Discriminatory treatment is an unfair, prejudicial response directed at individuals or groups based on biased evaluations by AI systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6ef0a2a22402771842f4d35bbf4be08d</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_5.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750857268</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Prohibited AI Practices">
      <data key="d0">Prohibited AI Practices</data>
      <data key="d1">CodeOfConduct</data>
      <data key="d2">Prohibited AI practices are guidelines that dictate unethical uses of AI technology, aimed at protecting individuals from manipulation and harm.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6ef0a2a22402771842f4d35bbf4be08d</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_5.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750857268</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Vulnerabilities of Natural Persons">
      <data key="d0">Vulnerabilities of Natural Persons</data>
      <data key="d1">RiskConcept</data>
      <data key="d2">The vulnerabilities of natural persons refer to specific weaknesses that AI systems may exploit, leading to significant negative impacts on affected individuals.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6ef0a2a22402771842f4d35bbf4be08d</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_5.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750857268</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Social Score">
      <data key="d0">Social Score</data>
      <data key="d1">Metric</data>
      <data key="d2">The social score is a measurement based on the social behavior or personality characteristics of individuals that can lead to favorable or unfavorable treatment in social contexts.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-83317eda1161cf5d13ef9aa07297c98b</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_5.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750857268</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Facial Recognition Database">
      <data key="d0">Facial Recognition Database</data>
      <data key="d1">AIComponent</data>
      <data key="d2">Facial recognition databases involve AI systems that collect and expand through the scraping of facial images from various sources, potentially leading to privacy concerns.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-83317eda1161cf5d13ef9aa07297c98b</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_5.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750857268</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Biometric Categorisation Systems">
      <data key="d0">Biometric Categorisation Systems</data>
      <data key="d1">AICapability</data>
      <data key="d2">Biometric categorisation systems utilize biometric data from individuals to infer or deduce personal attributes such as political opinions and beliefs.&lt;SEP&gt;These systems classify individuals based on biometric data to infer personal traits such as race, beliefs, or sexual orientation, raising ethical issues.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-83317eda1161cf5d13ef9aa07297c98b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3070277451614bdc67954ec8735dd80</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_30.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_5.json</data>
