    <node id="Real-Time Remote Biometric Identification Systems">
      <data key="d0">Real-Time Remote Biometric Identification Systems</data>
      <data key="d1">AIComponent</data>
      <data key="d2">Real-Time Remote Biometric Identification Systems refer to technological systems used for identifying individuals in public spaces for law enforcement purposes.&lt;SEP&gt;Real-time biometric identification systems are utilized in public spaces for law enforcement purposes, subject to strict necessity criteria.&lt;SEP&gt;Real-time remote biometric identification systems are used for law enforcement purposes, particularly in public spaces, to confirm the identity of targeted individuals.&lt;SEP&gt;These systems are designed to identify individuals based on biometric data in real-time, particularly in public spaces for law enforcement.&lt;SEP&gt;Real-time remote biometric identification systems are AI systems used for confirming individual identities in publicly accessible spaces for law enforcement purposes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-83317eda1161cf5d13ef9aa07297c98b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc038db2f25d511bf84cccc9550e10c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0073df6368131f4f385a66430ef1c4f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-911571ee28a1070a8fcc503dd5d91e14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-239d42cf353b4be7fdeade1f3fced85d</data>
