      <data key="d0">Real-time Remote Biometric Identification Systems</data>
      <data key="d1">AICapability</data>
      <data key="d2">These systems are used in public spaces for identifying individuals and are generally employed for law enforcement purposes, subject to strict regulations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1be166c61f466e23c3d8c143f6efd3bb</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_5.json</data>
