    </node>
    <node id="Emotions">
      <data key="d0">Emotions</data>
      <data key="d1">AISubject</data>
      <data key="d2">Emotions are human psychological states that can be inferred by AI systems from facial images and other biometric data.&lt;SEP&gt;Emotions such as happiness, sadness, anger, and others are the intended outcomes derived from the emotion recognition system.&lt;SEP&gt;Emotions can vary considerably across cultures and situations, impacting the effectiveness of AI in identification or inference operations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-61cbf514bcfe4869e269c00a2dc9e712&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1be166c61f466e23c3d8c143f6efd3bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dead6db59d178a53a4fc03ed67a92e7</data>
