    </node>
    <node id="Remote Biometric Identification Systems">
      <data key="d0">Remote Biometric Identification Systems</data>
      <data key="d1">AICapability</data>
      <data key="d2">Remote biometric identification systems are technologies used for law enforcement in publicly accessible spaces, under specific authorizations.&lt;SEP&gt;These systems facilitate the identification of individuals in real-time using biometric data, often applied in public spaces for security and law enforcement purposes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1be166c61f466e23c3d8c143f6efd3bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50be48c46c67191e901c756873069fcb</data>
