    <node id="Targeted Scraping">
      <data key="d0">Targeted Scraping</data>
      <data key="d1">Technique</data>
      <data key="d2">Targeted scraping refers to the practice of collecting specific data, such as facial images, from online platforms and other sources, often for use in artificial intelligence.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1be166c61f466e23c3d8c143f6efd3bb</data>
