      <data key="d0">Article 11(3)</data>
      <data key="d1">Regulation</data>
      <data key="d2">Article 11(3) refers to conditions for the delegation of powers to the Commission for specific legislative enforcement.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-da5fbf959baa6ee8e86278864a9144cc</data>
