      <data key="d0">Article 98(2)</data>
      <data key="d1">Regulation</data>
      <data key="d2">Article 98(2) outlines the examination procedure for implementing acts within a regulatory context.&lt;SEP&gt;Article 98(2) refers to the examination procedure utilized for adopting implementing acts related to AI regulations.</data>
