    <node id="2 May 2025">
      <data key="d0">2 May 2025</data>
      <data key="d1">Timeline</data>
      <data key="d2">2 May 2025 is the deadline for having codes of practice ready for general-purpose AI model providers.&lt;SEP&gt;The deadline for finalizing the Codes of Practice to ensure compliance by the relevant stakeholders.</data>
