    <node id="Regulation (EU) 2019/1020">
      <data key="d0">Regulation (EU) 2019/1020</data>
      <data key="d1">Regulation</data>
      <data key="d2">Regulation (EU) 2019/1020 establishes a comprehensive legal and regulatory framework governing the market surveillance and compliance of artificial intelligence (AI) systems within the European Union. This regulation primarily targets high-risk AI technologies, including general-purpose AI models, and outlines specific compliance requirements and procedures that must be adhered to by AI system providers.

The regulation defines the roles and responsibilities of market surveillance authorities, emphasizing their essential function in ensuring that products comply with established standards. It introduces a structured framework for the tasks related to the testing and compliance of AI systems, particularly focusing on high-risk scenarios. Moreover, it articulates the obligations for compliance monitoring and corrective actions to be undertaken in cases of non-compliance.

Regulation (EU) 2019/1020 specifies the reporting obligations and procedures that must be followed in the event of serious incidents involving AI systems, particularly emphasizing the notification requirements for high-risk systems. Additionally, it lays down provisions for the supervision and access to information on these systems, thereby reinforcing accountability and transparency.

By setting harmonized rules for compliance and enhancing oversight across all EU Member States, Regulation (EU) 2019/1020 aims to strengthen the integrity of market surveillance activities. This regulation effectively modernizes previous legislation to cater to the rapid advancements in AI technologies, ensuring that both devices and products meet the required compliance standards across the Union.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation (EU) 2019/1020 lays out provisions for market surveillance and compliance of products within the EU.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f12c01099dadb1fc1008ce18c7d800e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e28e08bfb7b1ae3208e2c91ea6f1e4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c27775e23d04f7dd6b8ec477a62efd1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f4ac0ccf9bd954306cee6efbfd342416&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ad9c740a10a5c1577e578a593bd61fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a5ff05678672211287e9053ebcd9c1c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc0fa7bd172fb09094c2d62c87957967&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0711090702fd9b1787822998d5deac9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c28a81721b7de3ef4442495cc499b1cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28daf57045ce50f0bd160cddd41ffc14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-610573a7c194ad780ed97782200a740c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43e82a7af456b2ae813a7217f92c2008&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83ca16d466deaa751e3b9dc390e91e2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8affbc363cca00e716c4494cb81a558a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0779dfb4a5c0f82f05a67985fe0224a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53fb2685a38836a165fa7637bbbadce2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cb2802f1b508b813d06e58ae27a1f77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40de45b5b0c24b78b7ef2ca4e835c29c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d58805118916ede230a82a4ec3f60b3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82b1b08be1175d2e6d49ab5a294ef86a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b0c31436f0e7ce27ce5952aa2bf9ae5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fcd3af92cad1d85ebf561f059acb114&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b90abf0636c26d546e9b6724e3224ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbe4515f5aa3b0876e436a8a0dffc23e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc8a3a685818e1a12850434d4ddcb5cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-345a8ba89ed0ea3325462384d5e16aaf</data>
