    <node id="Regulation (EC) No 300/2008">
      <data key="d0">Regulation (EC) No 300/2008</data>
      <data key="d1">Regulation</data>
      <data key="d2">Regulation (EC) No 300/2008 establishes common rules in the field of civil aviation security and repeals an earlier regulation.&lt;SEP&gt;This regulation outlines common rules in the field of civil aviation security and repeals the previous Regulation (EC) No 2320/2002.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation (EC) No 300/2008 establishes rules related to the safeguarding of community air traffic against acts of unlawful interference.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation (EC) No 300/2008 includes provisions regarding technical specifications and approval measures for security equipment, impacting the deployment of AI systems.</data>
