    </node>
    <node id="Regulation (EU) No 167/2013">
      <data key="d0">Regulation (EU) No 167/2013</data>
      <data key="d1">Regulation</data>
      <data key="d2">Regulation (EU) No 167/2013 pertains to the approval and market surveillance of agricultural and forestry vehicles.&lt;SEP&gt;This regulation pertains to the approval and market surveillance of agricultural and forestry vehicles.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation (EU) No 167/2013 provides a framework for the oversight of various components, including artificial intelligence systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation (EU) No 167/2013 refers to the type-approval and market surveillance of agricultural and forestry vehicles.</data>
