    </node>
    <node id="Directive 2014/90/EU">
      <data key="d0">Directive 2014/90/EU</data>
      <data key="d1">Regulation</data>
      <data key="d2">Directive 2014/90/EU is a legislative act of the European Union that outlines regulations pertaining to artificial intelligence systems as safety components.&lt;SEP&gt;Directive 2014/90/EU outlines regulations on marine equipment and repeals a previous directive on the same topic.&lt;SEP&gt;This directive governs marine equipment and repeals Council Directive 96/98/EC.&lt;SEP&gt;Directive 2014/90/EU pertains to the marine equipment directive, establishing requirements for marine equipment to ensure safety and compliance.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e86452bf9fab5e4da73d81e6eadabb30&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3acb107043f5850a72cf1b047a443296&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6485ea34e7fea16b2f5a59242c8ef2a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4ba1d5ee9be6a9378df917d6a467f31</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_49.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_105.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_110.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750859388</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Directive (EU) 2016/797">
      <data key="d0">Directive (EU) 2016/797</data>
      <data key="d1">Regulation</data>
      <data key="d2">Directive (EU) 2016/797 is a legislative act concerning the adoption of delegated and implementing acts related to Artificial Intelligence systems as safety components.&lt;SEP&gt;Directive (EU) 2016/797 pertains to the interoperability of the rail system within the European Union, aiming for cohesive operation among member states.&lt;SEP&gt;Directive (EU) 2016/797 regulates the interoperability of the rail system within the European Union.&lt;SEP&gt;This directive provides regulations related to the interoperability of the railway system within the European Union.&lt;SEP&gt;Directive (EU) 2016/797 relates to the interoperability of the rail system within the European Union.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e0b46b9cdd1723562953df9638581250&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4ba1d5ee9be6a9378df917d6a467f31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e86452bf9fab5e4da73d81e6eadabb30&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6485ea34e7fea16b2f5a59242c8ef2a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2af15b193dbeb2497919d2971657871e</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_49.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_106.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_110.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750859388</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Regulation (EU) 2018/858">
      <data key="d0">Regulation (EU) 2018/858</data>
      <data key="d1">Regulation</data>
      <data key="d2">Regulation (EU) 2018/858 is a comprehensive legal framework that governs the approval and market surveillance of motor vehicles and their trailers, as well as their components. The regulation focuses on ensuring safety and compliance in relation to these vehicles and their associated parts. It outlines the necessary procedures for the approval of motor vehicles, their components, and includes specifics on the market oversight of these products. Additionally, Regulation (EU) 2018/858 addresses the deployment of certain technologies and systems, particularly pertaining to safety components related to Artificial Intelligence, thereby enhancing the overall safety standards within the automotive sector.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d4ba1d5ee9be6a9378df917d6a467f31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e86452bf9fab5e4da73d81e6eadabb30&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be3ac2351d8798fda8093d05f96f97fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6485ea34e7fea16b2f5a59242c8ef2a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2af15b193dbeb2497919d2971657871e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c472ba24566e25512f738275d98a9e3b</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_49.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_107.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_110.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750859388</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Regulation (EU) 2018/1139">
      <data key="d0">Regulation (EU) 2018/1139</data>
      <data key="d1">Regulation</data>
      <data key="d2">Regulation (EU) 2018/1139 concerns the common rules in the field of civil aviation and establishing a European Union Aviation Safety Agency.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation (EU) 2018/1139 establishes common rules for civil aviation and creates the European Union Aviation Safety Agency to oversee safety standards.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation (EU) 2018/1139 establishes common rules in the field of civil aviation and sets up the European Union Aviation Safety Agency.&lt;SEP&gt;This regulation pertains to the safety of civil aviation and strengthens the European Union's safety standards.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation (EU) 2018/1139 outlines the legal framework concerning artificial intelligence systems within the European Union, particularly focusing on safety components.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d4ba1d5ee9be6a9378df917d6a467f31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e86452bf9fab5e4da73d81e6eadabb30&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6485ea34e7fea16b2f5a59242c8ef2a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2af15b193dbeb2497919d2971657871e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7805654ce0fe0d8d9b6ba008562d2aa</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_110.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_108.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_49.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750862693</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Regulation (EU) 2019/2144">
      <data key="d0">Regulation (EU) 2019/2144</data>
      <data key="d1">Regulation</data>
      <data key="d2">Regulation (EU) 2019/2144 is a legislative act concerning type-approval requirements for motor vehicles, focusing on safety standards and protection for occupants and vulnerable road users.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation (EU) 2019/2144 sets forth type-approval requirements for motor vehicles, emphasizing safety and protection for vehicle occupants and vulnerable road users.&lt;SEP&gt;This regulation updates the framework for the approval of motor vehicles with regard to the General Safety Regulation.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation (EU) 2019/2144 specifies the requirements for the type-approval of motor vehicles with respect to their environmental performance.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation (EU) 2019/2144 sets forth rules and guidelines for the regulation of certain topics, including artificial intelligence systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d4ba1d5ee9be6a9378df917d6a467f31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be3ac2351d8798fda8093d05f96f97fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6485ea34e7fea16b2f5a59242c8ef2a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9e2499910b26136c66e6e7a013d8f0b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2af15b193dbeb2497919d2971657871e</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_109.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_49.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_110.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750861669</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Committee on Artificial Intelligence">
      <data key="d0">Committee on Artificial Intelligence</data>
      <data key="d1">Stakeholder</data>
      <data key="d2">The committee responsible for overseeing and regulating the use of artificial intelligence in various sectors, including high-risk AI systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d4ba1d5ee9be6a9378df917d6a467f31</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_49.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750857374</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Conformity Assessment">
      <data key="d0">Conformity Assessment</data>
      <data key="d1">QualityMeasurement</data>
      <data key="d2">Conformity Assessment evaluates the AI systems to ascertain compliance with existing legislation.&lt;SEP&gt;Conformity Assessment is a comprehensive process dedicated to evaluating the compliance of high-risk AI systems with established legal standards and regulations. This systematic assessment is crucial for verifying that such AI systems adhere to specified obligations and meet defined regulatory requirements. Legally mandated, the conformity assessment ensures that these high-risk technologies fulfill necessary standards before being marketed or deployed, thereby safeguarding compliance and protecting public interest.

The process involves thorough evaluation techniques designed to determine whether products, particularly high-risk AI systems, align with outlined regulations and standards. By ensuring that these systems comply with legal requirements, conformity assessments serve as an essential mechanism for verifying the reliability and safety of high-risk AI technologies. In summary, Conformity Assessment plays a vital role in maintaining regulatory compliance and ensuring the responsible deployment of AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Conformity assessment refers to the evaluation process to ensure AI systems comply with relevant regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Conformity Assessment is a rigorous evaluation process to verify that products, including AI systems, meet regulatory standards for safety and effectiveness.&lt;SEP&gt;Conformity assessment is the process through which AI systems are evaluated to ensure they comply with the regulatory requirements set forth by relevant authorities.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c3ee1fc3ca38d0fe1cd19861a325e159&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4329be6d4972c392a3a71593d402998&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f55b689ece7aa049c38fdc38018dba8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c237e1a0b42db9afb10cc8a045dbb751&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4ba1d5ee9be6a9378df917d6a467f31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d1d974005cd87fc21678c732472ee11a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f5fc2b531499a81e154196ee1e86ac6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbe4515f5aa3b0876e436a8a0dffc23e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8efd21db4fc63a879493cbb376ae904&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be61089eed18cfaf2703713378c589a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c168b1207668ad4ba646371f91bfce09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70555b8168fcbd401cc11093ec15091a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-759ef1bca08a56dec0192e47771d9820&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b4348ad8873ef2041aca94abc9297ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-878d589bc7b69ae2d9c3a44284a1badc</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_86.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_34.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_51.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_123.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_33.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_124.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_147.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_128.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_6.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_130.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_3.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_49.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_25.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_74.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750863711</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Market Surveillance">
      <data key="d0">Market Surveillance</data>
      <data key="d1">AICapability</data>
      <data key="d2">Market Surveillance encompasses activities aimed at evaluating market conditions to ensure compliance with regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Market surveillance involves monitoring and enforcing compliance within the market for AI systems to ensure safety and adherence to regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Market surveillance refers to the activities of authorities designated to monitor compliance with regulations and enforce obligations for various products, including AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Market surveillance refers to the activities to monitor products and ensure they meet regulatory requirements after they have been placed on the market.&lt;SEP&gt;Market surveillance is the process of monitoring the deployment and performance of technologies in the market to ensure compliance with regulations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-aacbea1ddddc58fbf14c882b36d9a6b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4ba1d5ee9be6a9378df917d6a467f31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ad9c740a10a5c1577e578a593bd61fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0711090702fd9b1787822998d5deac9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-878d589bc7b69ae2d9c3a44284a1badc</data>
