    <node id="Directive (EU) 2016/680">
      <data key="d0">Directive (EU) 2016/680</data>
      <data key="d1">Regulation</data>
      <data key="d2">Directive (EU) 2016/680 aims to protect individuals' personal data in the context of criminal law enforcement.&lt;SEP&gt;Directive (EU) 2016/680 is a comprehensive regulation focused on the protection of personal data within the context of law enforcement and judicial cooperation in the European Union. It specifically addresses the processing of personal data, including biometric data, defining it in Article 3, point (13). The directive aims to establish a legal framework that ensures the protection of individuals' privacy rights and freedoms during investigations, particularly in relation to the prevention, detection, investigation, and prosecution of criminal offenses.

This directive delineates specific rules and obligations for competent authorities regarding the handling of personal data, emphasizing the importance of compliance with privacy rights. It plays a crucial role in data protection, notably in relation to high-risk artificial intelligence (AI) systems used within law enforcement. Moreover, Directive (EU) 2016/680 also regulates the free movement of personal data among law enforcement authorities, thereby enhancing cooperation and effectiveness in combating crime.

Through these provisions, Directive (EU) 2016/680 safeguards individuals' rights concerning their personal data while ensuring that entities involved in law enforcement processes adhere to legal obligations that respect and protect privacy rights.&lt;SEP&gt;Directive (EU) 2016/680 sets conditions and guidelines for the protection of personal data in the EU, affecting market surveillance activities.&lt;SEP&gt;The directive addresses the processing of personal data by competent authorities for the purposes of law enforcement.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-15eee417af0ebe299ed66be76a0b845a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee1f186f5aed070bc8e6e813caed9967&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-498834b2d84eaf9afe4e5fb0df15933c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0373d38f7600f51def3b5e5cb5061d17&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c1d05b847c03fe702172f787883fc33&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-737358b61293029e1a6d7326160654fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3cb5eb81289d4fb565bd824bdc63506&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a46250ea72037444e96653239f2893b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4988a00689afb1245e0f0ce4ceef5921&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de40ca48bf7dafc1db86f4d8a18d2bba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f736e1ff707eaba05079b0f194d8a123&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2bccefc944ad0794c75bc69b977c88a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-602b68fe088482c0037845fc0b520c30&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de3f18a6d766d2baa57ae891b9da7741&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8da189e7622be67a80b2e12945a657cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4882abf1dd869d3dff00b8d88ee946a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e726a1ef8f481d54c995afc6a028f60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85605aee8aaac2bf4ad29d80d902148f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc8a3a685818e1a12850434d4ddcb5cb</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_26.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_14.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_140.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_70.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_10.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_159.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_50.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_94.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_38.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_3.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_93.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_95.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_74.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750863700</data>
    </node>
    <node id="personal data">
      <data key="d0">personal data</data>
      <data key="d1">Data</data>
      <data key="d2">Personal data encompasses any data that relates to an identified or identifiable individual, subject to specific legal protections under EU regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Personal data includes any information relating to an identified or identifiable individual that market surveillance authorities may access during investigations.&lt;SEP&gt;Personal data is defined as data that relates to an identified or identifiable individual, as outlined in Regulation (EU) 2016/679.&lt;SEP&gt;Personal data refers to any information related to an identifiable individual, which is protected under data protection regulations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-cfc036b3a79fdcd1eb36c0af6aafbb4d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76a2f07f347fedfe788b6636feb212d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-828a2d9070cae319b764e3b609bc9b81&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f736e1ff707eaba05079b0f194d8a123</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_40.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_3.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_159.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_100.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750859985</data>
    </node>
    <node id="law enforcement">
      <data key="d0">law enforcement</data>
      <data key="d1">Purpose</data>
      <data key="d2">Law enforcement is the primary purpose described in the regulation for the use of specified data.&lt;SEP&gt;Law enforcement refers to activities conducted by authorities for the prevention, investigation, detection, or prosecution of criminal offenses, ensuring public security.&lt;SEP&gt;Law enforcement represents an area where high-risk AI systems may be deployed, affecting public safety and legal processes.&lt;SEP&gt;Law enforcement refers to the organized system by which certain members of society act in an organized manner to enforce the law, including the use of high-risk AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Law enforcement refers to governmental authorities tasked with the enforcement of laws and maintenance of public order and safety.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d91755cda6acde2b40257e6d4cef1695&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f736e1ff707eaba05079b0f194d8a123&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfc036b3a79fdcd1eb36c0af6aafbb4d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2035e81a92cf42f945220e637e40591a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5644d48de211c02e29152f909c69640b</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_14.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_159.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_33.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_3.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_38.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750862969</data>
    </node>
    <node id="migration">
      <data key="d0">migration</data>
      <data key="d1">AreaOfImpact</data>
      <data key="d2">Migration refers to the movement of individuals from one location to another, which may involve the use of high-risk AI systems for processing.&lt;SEP&gt;Migration refers to the movement of people, which can be managed or analyzed using high-risk AI systems within the context of border control.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f736e1ff707eaba05079b0f194d8a123&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5644d48de211c02e29152f909c69640b</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_159.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_14.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750857787</data>
    </node>
    <node id="asylum">
      <data key="d0">asylum</data>
      <data key="d1">AreaOfImpact</data>
      <data key="d2">Asylum procedures may utilize AI systems to assess claims for refugee status, affecting individual rights and legal outcomes.&lt;SEP&gt;Asylum refers to the protection granted to individuals who flee their home country, often assessed using high-risk AI systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f736e1ff707eaba05079b0f194d8a123&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5644d48de211c02e29152f909c69640b</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_159.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_14.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750857787</data>
    </node>
    <node id="border control management">
      <data key="d0">border control management</data>
      <data key="d1">AreaOfImpact</data>
      <data key="d2">Border control management involves overseeing the passage of individuals across borders, often utilizing AI technologies for efficiency and security.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f736e1ff707eaba05079b0f194d8a123</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_159.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750857377</data>
    </node>
    <node id="administration of justice">
      <data key="d0">administration of justice</data>
      <data key="d1">AreaOfImpact</data>
      <data key="d2">The administration of justice involves maintaining the rule of law, where AI systems may help streamline processes in legal contexts.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f736e1ff707eaba05079b0f194d8a123</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_159.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750857377</data>
