      <data key="d0">General-purpose AI systems</data>
      <data key="d1">AIComponent</data>
      <data key="d2">General-purpose AI systems can operate independently or as part of other high-risk AI systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a67563c32c3414ab14ce22666bed23dc</data>
