    </node>
    <node id="AI value chain">
      <data key="d0">AI value chain</data>
      <data key="d1">AreaOfImpact</data>
      <data key="d2">The AI value chain refers to the stages involved in the development, deployment, and management of AI systems, emphasizing the responsibilities of providers.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a67563c32c3414ab14ce22666bed23dc</data>
