    </node>
    <node id="Testing and Reporting Processes">
      <data key="d0">Testing and Reporting Processes</data>
      <data key="d1">QualityMeasurement</data>
      <data key="d2">Testing and reporting processes are essential for AI systems to demonstrate compliance with regulation and safety standards.&lt;SEP&gt;Testing and reporting processes are necessary procedures that may be integrated by providers to ensure high-risk AI systems comply with the regulation.</data>
