      <data key="d0">Standardisation Development Processes</data>
      <data key="d1">AITechnique</data>
      <data key="d2">Standardisation development processes are initiatives to align SMEs and other stakeholders with best practices in AI deployment.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3d6ed86abb2e8f0e12897e923d1e9964</data>
