    <node id="Conformity Assessment Fees">
      <data key="d0">Conformity Assessment Fees</data>
      <data key="d1">Metric</data>
      <data key="d2">Conformity Assessment Fees are fees that SMEs must pay to comply with regulations, with provisions for proportional reductions based on their size.&lt;SEP&gt;Conformity assessment fees are costs set by notified bodies for assessing compliance with regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Conformity assessment fees are costs set by notified bodies for certifying AI system compliance, which should take into account the size and capacity of SMEs.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e76c1f88e5810a7e79cf9527486831e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d6ed86abb2e8f0e12897e923d1e9964&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-712b56cbfc73c46eacde9204fa4e5c49</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_62.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_143.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750861717</data>
    </node>
