      <data key="d0">Single Information Platform</data>
      <data key="d1">AICapability</data>
      <data key="d2">A single information platform is a resource designed to provide easy-to-use information regarding AI regulations for all providers and deployers.&lt;SEP&gt;A single information platform is intended to provide easy access to information regarding regulations for all providers and deployers.&lt;SEP&gt;The Single Information Platform is a proposed system to enhance transparency and accessibility of information regarding AI Regulatory Sandboxes and their outcomes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d08b537f9a5bb2b4f4bbdf442ba39bdd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d6ed86abb2e8f0e12897e923d1e9964&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-712b56cbfc73c46eacde9204fa4e5c49</data>
