    <node id="Start-ups">
      <data key="d0">Start-ups</data>
      <data key="d1">Stakeholder</data>
      <data key="d2">Start-ups are a specific type of SME that are emerging providers or deployers of AI technologies.&lt;SEP&gt;Start-ups refer to newly established businesses that participate as stakeholders in the regulatory conversations.&lt;SEP&gt;Start-ups are recognized as stakeholders that the Commission aims to support with the guidelines on AI.</data>
