    <node id="Eligibility Conditions">
      <data key="d0">Eligibility Conditions</data>
      <data key="d1">Regulation</data>
      <data key="d2">Eligibility Conditions are the criteria that SMEs must meet to gain access to AI regulatory sandboxes.&lt;SEP&gt;Eligibility conditions are the criteria that SMEs must meet to gain access to AI regulatory sandboxes and support measures.</data>
