      <data key="d0">Mandatory Documentation</data>
      <data key="d1">Documentation</data>
      <data key="d2">Mandatory documentation refers to required paperwork that SMEs must provide for compliance with AI regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Mandatory documentation refers to the required documents that SMEs must provide to demonstrate compliance with the Regulation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3d6ed86abb2e8f0e12897e923d1e9964&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-712b56cbfc73c46eacde9204fa4e5c49</data>
