    </node>
    <node id="Standardised Templates">
      <data key="d0">Standardised Templates</data>
      <data key="d1">Documentation</data>
      <data key="d2">Standardised templates are pre-defined documents created by the AI Office to ensure consistency and compliance with the Regulation across various operators.&lt;SEP&gt;Standardised templates are pre-designed documents provided to SMEs to assist with compliance documentation related to AI regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Standardised templates are provided by the Commission to assist SMEs with compliance under the Regulation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e3d60cf6cbe0ae91a9793cb5c98a4a92&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d6ed86abb2e8f0e12897e923d1e9964&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-712b56cbfc73c46eacde9204fa4e5c49</data>
