    </node>
    <node id="Monetisation">
      <data key="d0">Monetisation</data>
      <data key="d1">Change</data>
      <data key="d2">Monetisation refers to the process of earning money through AI components, which is regulated to protect free access.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7ef570a9dfbda3c55d0d5bcc36fd77c5</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_103.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750857546</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Microenterprises">
      <data key="d0">Microenterprises</data>
      <data key="d1">AIDeployer</data>
      <data key="d2">Microenterprises are small businesses that may be exempt from certain regulations regarding the monetization of AI components.&lt;SEP&gt;Microenterprises refer to very small businesses defined under Recommendation 2003/361/EC that are subject to specific regulatory requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;Microenterprises are small operators that will be allowed to establish a simplified quality management system to reduce costs and administrative burden.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ad25bfaa86145b8556e5d82696b8bab4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ef570a9dfbda3c55d0d5bcc36fd77c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e4f07f79ad3c90c82b86c0a02d0fae9</data>
