    <node id="Tools">
      <data key="d0">Tools</data>
      <data key="d1">AIComponent</data>
      <data key="d2">Tools are various software and hardware resources used in the development and deployment of AI systems, provided by third parties.&lt;SEP&gt;Tools refer to software applications or utilities that assist in developing, testing, and deploying AI components.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7ef570a9dfbda3c55d0d5bcc36fd77c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-778cb9e68fcb25e3f810e3cea927f7b2</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_103.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_89.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750862035</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Processes">
      <data key="d0">Processes</data>
      <data key="d1">AICapability</data>
      <data key="d2">Processes refer to systematic sequences of operations and tasks that facilitate AI implementation and use.&lt;SEP&gt;Processes refer to the series of actions taken by AI systems to achieve a particular outcome or functionality.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7ef570a9dfbda3c55d0d5bcc36fd77c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-778cb9e68fcb25e3f810e3cea927f7b2</data>
