      <data key="d1">Regulation</data>
      <data key="d2">Mandatory requirements are legal obligations designed to ensure high-risk AI systems meet safety and performance standards before they are put into service.&lt;SEP&gt;Mandatory requirements are legal obligations that ensure high-risk AI systems do not pose unacceptable risks to public interests in the Union.</data>
