      <data key="d0">Sectoral Law</data>
      <data key="d1">Regulation</data>
      <data key="d2">Sectoral law pertains to legislative frameworks that do not address risks specific to AI systems, necessitating complementary applications to existing laws.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-fa2298fd83910d35175065de74977bd4</data>
