      <data key="d1">Change</data>
      <data key="d2">Operational decisions are choices made by providers regarding how to comply with regulations, affecting the deployment of AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Operational decisions refer to the flexibility providers have in deciding how to comply with requirements for products containing high-risk AI systems in accordance with legislation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ca3e6894a9009f1db207c0ec639d8a39&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa2298fd83910d35175065de74977bd4</data>
