      <data key="d1">Documentation</data>
      <data key="d2">The annex to the Regulation contains lists of AI systems considered high-risk, guiding registration requirements for those systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The annex to the regulation lists specific criteria and requirements applicable to high-risk AI systems.</data>
