    <node id="Competence">
      <data key="d0">Competence</data>
      <data key="d1">QualityMeasurement</data>
      <data key="d2">Competence refers to the necessary skills and knowledge required by natural persons to verify AI system identifications.&lt;SEP&gt;Competence refers to the required capabilities and qualifications of notified bodies to effectively evaluate tasks conducted by external parties.&lt;SEP&gt;Competence reflects the necessary skills and knowledge that personnel must have to correctly implement and monitor AI systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-28717558f1bb8bd2fd8b9542f8e2a99c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8721c261d628c538814f61ffe3cec22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5644d48de211c02e29152f909c69640b</data>
