      <data key="d1">AIDeployer</data>
      <data key="d2">Competent conformity assessment bodies are organizations that validate compliance with technical regulations, facilitating mutual recognition across borders.&lt;SEP&gt;Conformity assessment bodies are organizations authorized to conduct compliance evaluations under specific regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Conformity assessment bodies are organizations that assess the compliance of AI systems with regulations and standards.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-21da71f798625922669f14e575cb5dcd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4337a268de724c492ca11805622faf1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff611ee371ea780574e9c16859c31f2f</data>
