      <data key="d0">Competent Conformity Assessment Bodies</data>
      <data key="d1">AICapability</data>
      <data key="d2">Competent conformity assessment bodies are organizations that validate compliance with technical regulations, necessary for mutual recognition of their assessments across borders.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b4337a268de724c492ca11805622faf1</data>
