    <node id="Applicable Requirements">
      <data key="d0">Applicable Requirements</data>
      <data key="d1">Regulation</data>
      <data key="d2">Applicable requirements are the established criteria that conformity assessment bodies must meet to ensure compliance with regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Applicable requirements outline the legal obligations that must be followed in the use of AI systems, ensuring compliance with Union and national law.</data>
