      <data key="d0">Agreement</data>
      <data key="d1">LegalBasis</data>
      <data key="d2">Agreement denotes the formal understanding between the Union and a Third Country for conducting assessments and compliance evaluations.&lt;SEP&gt;An agreement in this context refers to a formal arrangement between the Union and third countries concerning mutual recognition of assessment results.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-21da71f798625922669f14e575cb5dcd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4337a268de724c492ca11805622faf1</data>
