      <data key="d1">Standard</data>
      <data key="d2">Model evaluation standards are standardized protocols ensuring the thorough assessment of AI models to identify and mitigate risks.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7cfbca03bf6afb99c3326dc8b02d083b</data>
