      <data key="d0">European Harmonised Standards</data>
      <data key="d1">Standard</data>
      <data key="d2">European harmonised standards outline requirements to demonstrate compliance for AI model providers and may grant presumption of conformity.&lt;SEP&gt;European harmonised standards provide benchmarks for compliance and governance of AI models with systemic risks.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7cfbca03bf6afb99c3326dc8b02d083b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c49e78c25e30ed3a2557915010f14f3c</data>
