    <node id="Compliance Obligations">
      <data key="d0">Compliance Obligations</data>
      <data key="d1">QualityMeasurement</data>
      <data key="d2">Compliance obligations are legal requirements that AI model providers must meet, tailored to the type of provider.&lt;SEP&gt;Compliance obligations refer to the legal requirements that AI model providers must meet regarding systemic risks and governance.&lt;SEP&gt;Compliance obligations refer to the requirements that notifying bodies and high-risk AI systems must fulfill to maintain their designations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-65c79a1c0cb37c10df906970d376029d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8caee37338a6383c30fe06ea2b3e4761&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cfbca03bf6afb99c3326dc8b02d083b</data>
