    </node>
    <node id="Corrective Measures">
      <data key="d0">Corrective Measures</data>
      <data key="d1">Change</data>
      <data key="d2">Corrective measures are actions taken by AI providers to address identified issues and mitigate systemic risks in their models.&lt;SEP&gt;Corrective measures are actions that a Member State may need to implement when a notified body is found non-compliant.</data>
