    <node id="Article 78">
      <data key="d0">Article 78</data>
      <data key="d1">Documentation</data>
      <data key="d2">Article 78 is a crucial provision that addresses the confidentiality and handling of sensitive information during investigations conducted by the Commission. It outlines specific confidentiality obligations for information obtained for compliance purposes, which is vital for maintaining the integrity and trust in regulatory processes. The article is set to be implemented as part of the regulations in effect from 2 August 2025 and defines important regulatory provisions that must be adhered to.

Furthermore, Article 78 establishes a legal framework that mandates confidentiality for information acquired by notified bodies during conformity assessments. It specifies the requirements for handling information and documentation throughout compliance assessments, ensuring that sensitive data is treated with the utmost care. Additionally, the article highlights strict confidentiality obligations concerning information related to high-risk AI systems, underscoring its significance in the oversight and regulation of advanced technological applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Article 78 outlines specific confidentiality requirements for information collected by national public authorities.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a8512760339eb776d946a91a28089b34&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e93fbd1f7fc7cbb860b708f989987b57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5abff9e94aff7675c473268fd21bf551&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97182f6b8815d40f51faf3e8eaeb7c7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc0fa7bd172fb09094c2d62c87957967&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fce1cda52753ec9e5183762f5b2c81b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a310ed4ba9b96c860daae9a944f07fce</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_75.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_45.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_77.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_37.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_55.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_113.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_53.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750863554</data>
    </node>
