    </node>
    <node id="imminent threat to life">
      <data key="d0">imminent threat to life</data>
      <data key="d1">Hazard</data>
      <data key="d2">An imminent threat to life refers to situations where there is an urgent risk to individuals' physical safety, necessitating the use of law enforcement tools.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d91755cda6acde2b40257e6d4cef1695</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_33.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750857807</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Directive (EU) 2022/2557">
      <data key="d0">Directive (EU) 2022/2557</data>
      <data key="d1">Regulation</data>
      <data key="d2">Directive (EU) 2022/2557 defines what constitutes critical infrastructure and its associated risks.&lt;SEP&gt;This directive focuses on the resilience of critical entities and repeals a prior directive regarding the same topic.&lt;SEP&gt;This directive outlines measures for the resilience of critical entities in the EU, including provisions for identity checks.&lt;SEP&gt;Directive (EU) 2022/2557 governs the classification of AI systems used in critical infrastructure management, emphasizing risk management.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ec6a8294e2a2ad2569029d260c4d7673&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6badc71855b10bbd17a31c7dfef0c442&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d91755cda6acde2b40257e6d4cef1695&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a23e03a78af2035b69e69bd4fc65a435</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_55.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_33.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750861656</data>
    </node>
    <node id="identity checks">
      <data key="d0">identity checks</data>
      <data key="d1">AIDeployer</data>
      <data key="d2">Identity checks are procedures carried out by authorities to verify the identity of individuals, using legal provisions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d91755cda6acde2b40257e6d4cef1695</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_33.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750857807</data>
    </node>
