    </node>
    <node id="Negative Consequences">
      <data key="d0">Negative Consequences</data>
      <data key="d1">Consequence</data>
      <data key="d2">Negative consequences are adverse effects that may result from criminal activities, impacting individuals and society.&lt;SEP&gt;Negative consequences are potential adverse effects arising from erroneous outcomes of high-risk AI systems, especially in sensitive applications.</data>
