      <data key="d0">Identity Disclosure</data>
      <data key="d1">QualityMeasurement</data>
      <data key="d2">Identity Disclosure refers to the requirement or inability of individuals to prove their identity to law enforcement authorities, especially in sensitive situations.</data>
