    <node id="High-Quality Data">
      <data key="d0">High-Quality Data</data>
      <data key="d1">Data</data>
      <data key="d2">High-quality data is essential for the structure and performance of AI systems, especially for training and validation of models.&lt;SEP&gt;High-quality data is essential for training AI systems to ensure their performance, accuracy, and robustness.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-bbcf833252ce65fd6a1d8bd1f5a6efc1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-445327adc051facf545b6358f6f01466</data>
