      <data key="d0">Transparency about Data Collection</data>
      <data key="d1">QualityMeasurement</data>
      <data key="d2">This requirement involves providing clarity on the original purpose for data collection to comply with data protection laws.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-445327adc051facf545b6358f6f01466</data>
