      <data key="d1">Regulation</data>
      <data key="d2">This regulation outlines horizontal cybersecurity requirements for products with digital elements, including high-risk AI systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6370e960da03a6bbdee69f64993cdae6</data>
