    </node>
    <node id="Cybersecurity Risks">
      <data key="d0">Cybersecurity Risks</data>
      <data key="d1">Risk</data>
      <data key="d2">Cybersecurity risks are threats to digital products, particularly high-risk AI systems, including potential attacks that may affect performance.&lt;SEP&gt;Cybersecurity risks involve potential threats to data security, particularly concerning the management and protection of the EU database.&lt;SEP&gt;Cybersecurity risks pertain to potential threats that might affect the functionality and safety of the EU Database as a data controller.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6370e960da03a6bbdee69f64993cdae6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-166a35f517674f4ceba2754c65f88c5f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2806e288e0b71013209c4ad85ecaa38b</data>
