      <data key="d1">CodeOfConduct</data>
      <data key="d2">Codes of Conduct and Codes of Practice provide ethical guidelines and best practices for the development and application of AI technologies.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-98532c431ec75ae38c76dc0730337a16</data>
