    <node id="Article 73">
      <data key="d0">Article 73</data>
      <data key="d1">Regulation</data>
      <data key="d2">Article 73 involves serious incident reports related to the evaluation of AI systems under this Regulation.&lt;SEP&gt;Article 73 pertains to the obligations and responsibilities of deployers in case they cannot reach the provider after a serious incident occurs.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-00e7606a0fa9d588f18d67d02cfcf654&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78dcdae0f5d22df28405d8ae03e038d0</data>
