    <node id="Consumer Protection">
      <data key="d0">Consumer Protection</data>
      <data key="d1">AreaOfImpact</data>
      <data key="d2">Consumer protection involves regulations and practices designed to safeguard buyers from unfair trade practices.&lt;SEP&gt;Consumer protection refers to regulations aimed at safeguarding users from potential risks associated with AI technologies.&lt;SEP&gt;This right aims to protect consumers from unfair practices, which can link to how AI algorithms affect market behavior.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-17045c951f494f621b2305960aade53f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-577494efd5ce842563e6974b0da9707b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e284955c1d36330bd14d117bb417611</data>
