    <node id="Professional Secrecy">
      <data key="d0">Professional Secrecy</data>
      <data key="d1">QualityMeasurement</data>
      <data key="d2">Professional Secrecy is a requirement ensuring that all personnel of notified bodies handle confidential information responsibly and discreetly.&lt;SEP&gt;Professional secrecy pertains to the obligation of personnel in notified bodies to maintain confidentiality regarding information obtained during assessments.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-fb8e27222ad9e21f792d1e7ee0a1e255&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be2e0f993ca9c4e593e5fcbdd8fc03fe</data>
