      <data key="d0">Coordination Activities</data>
      <data key="d1">AICapability</data>
      <data key="d2">Coordination activities involve collaboration with European standardisation organizations to ensure compliance with relevant standards.&lt;SEP&gt;Coordination activities involve various efforts taken by notified bodies in conjunction with standardization organizations related to AI systems.</data>
