    <node id="Confidential Information">
      <data key="d0">Confidential Information</data>
      <data key="d1">Data</data>
      <data key="d2">Confidential information encompasses sensitive data that must be protected from unauthorized disclosure according to legal standards.&lt;SEP&gt;Confidential information refers to sensitive data acquired by notified bodies during the performance of their assessments, which must remain secure.&lt;SEP&gt;Confidential information refers to sensitive data exchanged between authorities that is not to be disclosed without proper consent or approval.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-fdf8a675497acfbeb420b95621b7cb31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be2e0f993ca9c4e593e5fcbdd8fc03fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75ec68339f2da8ef06976767a0d5b494</data>
