    <node id="European Standardisation Organisations">
      <data key="d0">European Standardisation Organisations</data>
      <data key="d1">AIDeveloper</data>
      <data key="d2">European Standardisation Organisations are crucial bodies within the European Union that are tasked with the creation, maintenance, and approval of standards and guidelines. These organisations ensure that notified bodies adhere to established standards during conformity assessments. They play a vital role in developing harmonised standards based on requests from the European Commission and are responsible for the acceptance and validation of these standardisation requests. Additionally, they focus on developing standards for artificial intelligence systems and products, aligning them with the broader EU framework. Overall, European Standardisation Organisations are essential in overseeing standardisation processes and ensuring compliance within the EU.</data>
