    <node id="Robustness">
      <data key="d0">Robustness</data>
      <data key="d1">QualityMeasurement</data>
      <data key="d2">Robustness indicates the ability of an AI system to function correctly under varied conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Robustness indicates the reliability and stability of high-risk AI systems under different operational conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Robustness indicates the resilience of high-risk AI systems against faults, errors, and inconsistencies that may occur during operation.&lt;SEP&gt;Robustness refers to the ability of high-risk AI systems to perform reliably in various conditions, ensuring stability despite potential disruptions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-671e76af4a78aebc96c988f0504bfa99&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20ac675fffdeba0fbc242b392d3af8da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2f186d6b95e69680f63fabb65ad924a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9685a1f72e235a3f5b9ee69878eedb21</data>
