    <node id="Human Oversight Measures">
      <data key="d0">Human Oversight Measures</data>
      <data key="d1">AICapability</data>
      <data key="d2">Human Oversight Measures refer to the protocols established to ensure that human operators can effectively monitor and interpret the outputs of AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Human oversight measures are technical strategies that enable human operators to supervise and interpret the outputs of high-risk AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Human oversight measures include protocols and practices designed to enhance understanding and management of AI system outputs.&lt;SEP&gt;Human oversight measures are strategies and mechanisms implemented to ensure that high-risk AI systems are monitored and controlled effectively.</data>
