    </node>
    <node id="Public Security">
      <data key="d0">Public Security</data>
      <data key="d1">AreaOfImpact</data>
      <data key="d2">Public security is the protection of citizens and the maintenance of public order, which can be threatened by inadequate safety measures in technology deployment.&lt;SEP&gt;Public security refers to the protection of individuals and the environment from threats related to the use of high-risk AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Public security represents the overarching goal of law enforcement authorities in ensuring safety and order in society.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2612abd3c26dca69a0acec30add3ef15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-878d589bc7b69ae2d9c3a44284a1badc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e07ee6b3452d764ccd9733dceadb1ac7</data>
