      <data key="d1">Change</data>
      <data key="d2">Urgency situations refer to conditions requiring immediate action, allowing for the rapid deployment of high-risk AI systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e07ee6b3452d764ccd9733dceadb1ac7</data>
