    </node>
    <node id="Consultation">
      <data key="d0">Consultation</data>
      <data key="d1">Change</data>
      <data key="d2">Consultation is the process of seeking advice from the European Data Protection Board regarding the Regulation and its implications for data protection practices.&lt;SEP&gt;Consultation is the process where the Commission and relevant stakeholders discuss objections raised regarding an authorization of a high-risk AI system.&lt;SEP&gt;Consultation refers to the process initiated when objections are raised concerning a measure taken by a market surveillance authority.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d1b92a727425c41637e16da3cb9ac9c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4c7e75432b8ffa8e0b96687dc4dd380&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee6d94a5f64203f09d02387acbdb39c5</data>
