      <data key="d0">Privacy-Preserving Measures</data>
      <data key="d1">QualityMeasurement</data>
      <data key="d2">Privacy-preserving measures are practices and protocols employed to protect sensitive information while using data for AI training.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8eae051373e28d701c4893438950556b</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_68.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750858569</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Scientific Panel of Independent Experts">
      <data key="d0">Scientific Panel of Independent Experts</data>
      <data key="d1">AICapability</data>
      <data key="d2">The scientific panel comprising independent experts is established to provide expertise and support for the enforcement of the Regulation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6579442a2f027e643cf907006333003a</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_151.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750858572</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Technical Expertise">
      <data key="d0">Technical Expertise</data>
      <data key="d1">QualityMeasurement</data>
      <data key="d2">Technical expertise refers to the up-to-date scientific or technical knowledge required for the independent experts involved in the scientific panel.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6579442a2f027e643cf907006333003a</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_151.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750858572</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Monitoring Activities">
      <data key="d0">Monitoring Activities</data>
      <data key="d1">QualityMeasurement</data>
      <data key="d2">Monitoring Activities refer to the systematic processes the AI Office conducts to assess AI models for compliance and potential risks.&lt;SEP&gt;Monitoring activities encompass the tasks performed by the AI Office to ensure compliance with the Regulation regarding AI models.&lt;SEP&gt;Monitoring activities involve the processes through which the notifying authority ensures ongoing compliance of high-risk AI systems post-assessment.&lt;SEP&gt;Monitoring activities involve the procedures that the AI Office undertakes to ensure the effective implementation of regulations concerning AI models.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8ec7c9ce58b650afe456517c2483e56c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6579442a2f027e643cf907006333003a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af991f85166d6ddfbbf84e4a73207d3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d1d974005cd87fc21678c732472ee11a</data>
