    <node id="notified bodies">
      <data key="d0">notified bodies</data>
      <data key="d1">AIDeployer</data>
      <data key="d2">Notified bodies are organizations that assess compliance of high-risk AI systems based on the submitted technical documentation, ensuring adherence to regulatory standards.&lt;SEP&gt;Notified bodies are organizations that have been designated to assess the conformity of products before they enter the market.&lt;SEP&gt;Notified bodies are organizations that provide conformity assessments for high-risk AI systems as part of the certification process.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a310ed4ba9b96c860daae9a944f07fce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36cb0fd5abf1b169a8aa13021f58c7b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a57bbcc3ccf00f26352f12c36036aedf</data>
