    <node id="Union Market for AI Systems">
      <data key="d0">Union Market for AI Systems</data>
      <data key="d1">AreaOfImpact</data>
      <data key="d2">The Union Market for AI Systems is an economic and regulatory area focused on the development and integration of artificial intelligence systems, particularly those offered by small and medium-sized enterprises (SMEs) and start-ups.&lt;SEP&gt;The Union Market for AI Systems refers to the marketplace where AI systems can be developed, tested, and deployed under regulatory oversight.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-184360d53ae652d7f48a919e168f375a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34333cde7ca701413cb4d0a0ef1129e1</data>
