      <data key="d1">AreaOfImpact</data>
      <data key="d2">Cross-Border Cooperation refers to collaboration between national authorities in different jurisdictions to manage and supervise AI sandboxes effectively.&lt;SEP&gt;Cross-border cooperation pertains to the collaboration between national authorities to manage AI systems effectively across different jurisdictions.</data>
