    <node id="Significant Risks">
      <data key="d0">Significant Risks</data>
      <data key="d1">Risk</data>
      <data key="d2">Significant Risks are potential hazards identified during the development and testing of AI Systems that may adversely affect their performance or safety.&lt;SEP&gt;Significant Risks refer to potential threats to health, safety, or fundamental rights identified in the deployment and testing of AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Significant risks pertain to potential threats to safety, health, and fundamental rights that may emerge during AI system development in the sandbox.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-184360d53ae652d7f48a919e168f375a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7859a0c655f74761757b416c3b50bf36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a46250ea72037444e96653239f2893b2</data>
