    <node id="Testing Process">
      <data key="d0">Testing Process</data>
      <data key="d1">AILifecyclePhase</data>
      <data key="d2">The Testing Process is a phase in the lifecycle of AI systems where prototypes or models are evaluated for compliance and performance in regulatory sandboxes.&lt;SEP&gt;The process through which AI systems are evaluated in real-world conditions to assess their efficacy and safety.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-184360d53ae652d7f48a919e168f375a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4518ca313d8493e277775e1a9267b84d</data>
