      <data key="d2">Guidance provided by national authorities ensures that sandbox activities adhere to established regulations and best practices.&lt;SEP&gt;Guidance refers to the recommendations and best practices provided to aid in understanding and ensuring compliance with regulatory requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;Guidance refers to the recommendations and support provided by the Board and the Commission on implementing the Regulation effectively.</data>
