    <node id="Notifying Authorities">
      <data key="d0">Notifying Authorities</data>
      <data key="d1">AIOperator</data>
      <data key="d2">Notifying Authorities are bodies responsible for informing stakeholders about compliance and market regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Notifying authorities are involved in the oversight of compliance related to AI regulations on the market.&lt;SEP&gt;Notifying authorities are responsible for notifying conformity assessment bodies that meet specified requirements as outlined in regulatory articles.&lt;SEP&gt;Notifying Authorities collaborate with the Board on market surveillance issues to comply with the requirements of the Regulation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d4058e2567f154203a2d9dacec4bdf7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e28e08bfb7b1ae3208e2c91ea6f1e4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83ca16d466deaa751e3b9dc390e91e2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f94df6da4de89cee24b1bd8f504c377</data>
