    </node>
    <node id="Rules of Procedure">
      <data key="d0">Rules of Procedure</data>
      <data key="d1">Documentation</data>
      <data key="d2">Rules of Procedure are established by the Board to guide the operation and decision-making process.&lt;SEP&gt;Rules of Procedure govern the manner in which the Board conducts its meetings and decision-making processes.&lt;SEP&gt;The Advisory Forum will draw up its rules of procedure to guide its operations and decision-making processes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ad86065dee426d0a1db7444552c4a385&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e28e08bfb7b1ae3208e2c91ea6f1e4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85d8b1632746db5110bcd9632c1ace58</data>
