    </node>
    <node id="Sub-groups">
      <data key="d0">Sub-groups</data>
      <data key="d1">AIComponent</data>
      <data key="d2">Sub-groups are specialized teams established by the Board to facilitate cooperation and resolve issues related to market surveillance.&lt;SEP&gt;The Board establishes sub-groups to enhance cooperation and focus on specific regulatory issues related to AI.&lt;SEP&gt;The Advisory Forum may establish standing or temporary sub-groups to examine specific questions related to its objectives.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ad86065dee426d0a1db7444552c4a385&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e28e08bfb7b1ae3208e2c91ea6f1e4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83ca16d466deaa751e3b9dc390e91e2f</data>
