    </node>
    <node id="Transparency-Related Requirements">
      <data key="d0">Transparency-Related Requirements</data>
      <data key="d1">Regulation</data>
      <data key="d2">Transparency-related requirements are obligations imposed on AI models, aiming to ensure accountability and compliance with standards.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-212b902a4529db42951674775ac3ec73</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_104.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750858853</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Union Copyright Law">
      <data key="d0">Union Copyright Law</data>
      <data key="d1">Regulation</data>
      <data key="d2">Union copyright law ensures compliance with rights reserved for creators and aims to protect intellectual property in the context of AI model training data.&lt;SEP&gt;Union copyright law governs the usage of intellectual property rights within the context of AI models and their compliance.&lt;SEP&gt;Union copyright law establishes the legal framework that AI providers must follow regarding the use of copyrighted content in AI training.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-65c79a1c0cb37c10df906970d376029d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32556db3a80f72f1db354810bba21be7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-212b902a4529db42951674775ac3ec73</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_104.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_109.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_108.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750863602</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Directive (EU) 2019/790">
      <data key="d0">Directive (EU) 2019/790</data>
      <data key="d1">Regulation</data>
      <data key="d2">Directive (EU) 2019/790 introduces exceptions and limitations to copyright laws that allow reproductions for text and data mining under certain conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Directive (EU) 2019/790 sets out specific rules concerning copyright and aims to ensure fair use and rights protection in the digital environment.&lt;SEP&gt;This directive outlines copyright legislation in the Digital Single Market, impacting how AI models must handle training data and copyright compliance.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f1ae06c8c76fc5976313d75e4ffabdfc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5429fed5961ecea1e5eed049e922476f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-212b902a4529db42951674775ac3ec73</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_104.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_105.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_106.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750863667</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Free and Open-Source License">
      <data key="d0">Free and Open-Source License</data>
      <data key="d1">License</data>
      <data key="d2">A Free and Open-Source License is designed to facilitate broad access to, and modification of, AI models. This type of license permits users to access, utilize, modify, and distribute AI models, contingent upon the fulfillment of specific conditions related to the model's parameters and architecture. It enables users to engage with the underlying code and architecture of the AI model without facing restrictive mandates. Additionally, while allowing for extensive usage of AI components, certain models that pose systemic risks may be excluded from specific obligations regarding distribution and modification. Overall, a Free and Open-Source License fosters collaboration and innovation by providing a framework that balances access with necessary precautions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-778cb9e68fcb25e3f810e3cea927f7b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-212b902a4529db42951674775ac3ec73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4dc89de2edca5d2bfe0d5e9e7c99665b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c49e78c25e30ed3a2557915010f14f3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b567607dbb431b0d294cd02679760039&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-873c3732f26f3ace86c77cfec67991ee</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_104.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_54.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_53.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_89.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750863106</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Model Training Data Summary">
      <data key="d0">Model Training Data Summary</data>
      <data key="d1">Data</data>
      <data key="d2">The summary of model training data includes information on content used to train AI models and its compliance with copyright law.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-212b902a4529db42951674775ac3ec73</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_104.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750858853</data>
    </node>
