      <data key="d0">Copyright and Related Rights Directive</data>
      <data key="d1">Regulation</data>
      <data key="d2">The directives 96/9/EC and 2001/29/EC pertain to copyright and related rights, governing the use of intellectual property in the digital sphere.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-feb00b9eef4af47cdd3264cd99d6b2e4</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_104.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750858853</data>
    </node>
