      <data key="d0">Copyright Directive 2019</data>
      <data key="d1">Regulation</data>
      <data key="d2">The Copyright Directive of 2019 seeks to harmonize copyright laws across the European Union to adapt to the digital environment and protect creators' rights.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-feb00b9eef4af47cdd3264cd99d6b2e4</data>
