      <data key="d1">AITechnique</data>
      <data key="d2">Inclusive design is an approach that ensures AI systems are accessible and meet the needs of diverse users, including those from vulnerable groups.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-064e3e5273a81cd8d9a47da9a3f51240</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_95.json</data>
