      <data key="d0">Diversity in Development Teams</data>
      <data key="d1">QualityMeasurement</data>
      <data key="d2">Diversity in development teams emphasizes inclusive practices and representation in AI development, aiming for balanced participation across gender and demographics.&lt;SEP&gt;Diversity in development teams refers to the practice of involving individuals from various backgrounds to enhance the design and implementation of AI systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0c14e1756e1d8d71ac3ba07125f122da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-064e3e5273a81cd8d9a47da9a3f51240</data>
