    <node id="Gender Equality">
      <data key="d0">Gender Equality</data>
      <data key="d1">QualityMeasurement</data>
      <data key="d2">Gender equality encompasses the equal rights, responsibilities, and opportunities of all genders, often a key consideration in AI system deployment.&lt;SEP&gt;This principle asserts equal rights and opportunities regardless of gender, highlighting relevant areas where AI may perpetuate biases.</data>
