    <node id="AI Providers">
      <data key="d0">AI Providers</data>
      <data key="d1">AIProvider</data>
      <data key="d2">AI Providers are organizations or entities that develop, supply, or manage AI models and are responsible for their compliance with governance frameworks.&lt;SEP&gt;AI providers are organizations or entities that develop and offer AI systems, encouraged to create voluntary codes to enhance ethical standards.&lt;SEP&gt;AI providers are organizations or individuals that develop and deploy AI systems, tasked with adhering to established codes of conduct.&lt;SEP&gt;AI Providers are organizations or individuals responsible for deploying AI systems while ensuring compliance with data protection regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;AI providers refer to entities offering AI systems, which must comply with the established regulations regardless of their location.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0c14e1756e1d8d71ac3ba07125f122da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40f3761e589fb7702938fd4fbbecfdcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a0c1908573a7d6a832a6b35befbd7ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d18c3755735a13a436e766a5ca73fc4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-714d9f621f6eee9273625419653b083c</data>
