      <data key="d1">Infrastructure</data>
      <data key="d2">Data Access Infrastructure is the set of tools and systems that enable access to data necessary for AI development.&lt;SEP&gt;Data access infrastructure refers to the technical frameworks that facilitate the exchange and accessibility of data necessary for AI development.</data>
