    <node id="Technical and Organisational Measures">
      <data key="d0">Technical and Organisational Measures</data>
      <data key="d1">AICapability</data>
      <data key="d2">Technical and organisational measures are implementations that Union institutions can use to demonstrate compliance with AI regulations and mitigate damages.&lt;SEP&gt;Technical and organisational measures refer to the necessary steps deployers must take to ensure safe and compliant use of AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Technical and organizational measures are strategies put in place to enhance the robustness and safety of high-risk AI systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5da2f6b1c2fa5619efa26719534e9c35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f15de033aa4361b6dbf4b5d72ede05a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8721c261d628c538814f61ffe3cec22</data>
