    </node>
    <node id="AI Literacy and Training">
      <data key="d0">AI Literacy and Training</data>
      <data key="d1">QualityMeasurement</data>
      <data key="d2">AI literacy and training are critical educational components ensuring that personnel can effectively oversee and implement AI systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c8721c261d628c538814f61ffe3cec22</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_91.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750859046</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Accreditation Certificate">
      <data key="d0">Accreditation Certificate</data>
      <data key="d1">Document</data>
      <data key="d2">An accreditation certificate attests to the competence of a conformity assessment body as evaluated by a national accreditation body.&lt;SEP&gt;An accreditation certificate serves as proof that a conformity assessment body meets specific standards and can perform its activities.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4f94df6da4de89cee24b1bd8f504c377&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff611ee371ea780574e9c16859c31f2f</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_30.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_29.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750862758</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Documentary Evidence">
      <data key="d0">Documentary Evidence</data>
      <data key="d1">Data</data>
      <data key="d2">Documentary evidence is required when the notification is not based on an accreditation certificate, attesting to the competence of the conformity assessment body.&lt;SEP&gt;Documentary evidence refers to the paperwork and documentation required for the verification and monitoring of compliance by conformity assessment bodies.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4f94df6da4de89cee24b1bd8f504c377&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff611ee371ea780574e9c16859c31f2f</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_30.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_29.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750862760</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Conformity Assessment Module">
      <data key="d0">Conformity Assessment Module</data>
      <data key="d1">AIComponent</data>
      <data key="d2">Conformity assessment modules are specific frameworks or processes used by conformity assessment bodies to evaluate AI systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4f94df6da4de89cee24b1bd8f504c377</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_30.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750859059</data>
    </node>
