    <node id="Request for Information">
      <data key="d0">Request for Information</data>
      <data key="d1">Change</data>
      <data key="d2">A Request for Information is a formal inquiry by market surveillance authorities seeking details on conformity assessment activities conducted by notified bodies.&lt;SEP&gt;A Request for Information is an official communication initiated by the Commission or the Scientific Panel to obtain necessary data from providers.</data>
