      <data key="d2">These activities encompass the evaluations performed by different notified bodies on AI systems that fall under comparable regulatory conditions and requirements.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f2a5e7031602556ef7d57e2811f58992</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_45.json</data>
