      <data key="d1">CodeOfConduct</data>
      <data key="d2">Confidentiality Safeguards relate to measures implemented by notified bodies to protect sensitive information gathered during conformity assessments, as mandated by regulatory articles.&lt;SEP&gt;Confidentiality safeguards ensure that sensitive information obtained during investigations is protected according to legal standards.</data>
