    <node id="Post Systems">
      <data key="d0">Post Systems</data>
      <data key="d1">AILifecyclePhase</data>
      <data key="d2">Post Systems refer to AI systems that analyze biometric data after it has been captured, resulting in significant delays in processing.&lt;SEP&gt;Post systems refer to AI frameworks where data is captured first and identification occurs later after a significant delay.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0f62cf38e10f73dd06a997571902c1ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d1a48b7c6d78e001878383cb0acaf58</data>
