    <node id="Protection of Personal Data">
      <data key="d0">Protection of Personal Data</data>
      <data key="d1">Regulation</data>
      <data key="d2">Protection of personal data involves safeguarding individuals' private information during all phases of AI system operation.&lt;SEP&gt;This right ensures that individuals' personal information is kept secure and used appropriately, particularly concerning AI technologies.&lt;SEP&gt;The protection of personal data is a legal framework that governs how personal information is handled in relation to AI systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7d18c3755735a13a436e766a5ca73fc4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1eea61d03ab615ac5f518e77cd220c1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e284955c1d36330bd14d117bb417611</data>
