    <node id="Workers Rights">
      <data key="d0">Workers Rights</data>
      <data key="d1">Consequence</data>
      <data key="d2">Such rights ensure fair treatment and working conditions for employees, relevant when discussing AI in workplaces.&lt;SEP&gt;Workers’ rights are entitlements that employees have in the workplace concerning their treatment, compensation, and working conditions, which can be influenced by AI systems.</data>
