      <data key="d2">Health and safety involve potential harm that AI systems may inflict on individuals due to their operation, which must be evaluated in risk assessments.&lt;SEP&gt;Health and safety refer to the potential adverse effects that AI systems may have on individuals, especially when these systems are integrated into products.&lt;SEP&gt;Health and safety refers to the overall well-being and protection of individuals in various environments, emphasizing preventive measures and care.&lt;SEP&gt;Health and safety refer to the protection measures included in the Regulation to safeguard individuals from harmful AI impacts.</data>
