      <data key="d1">HumanInvolvement</data>
      <data key="d2">Human Review is the process through which content produced by AI is assessed for accuracy, quality, and ethical standards by a person.&lt;SEP&gt;Human review is the process where human judgment is interposed into decision outcomes made by AI systems to ensure validity and compliance.</data>
