      <data key="d0">Natural Person</data>
      <data key="d1">AIDeployer</data>
      <data key="d2">A natural person is an individual human who may act as a deployer of an AI system under this Regulation.&lt;SEP&gt;Natural Person signifies an individual who has legal rights and can be held responsible for content published.&lt;SEP&gt;Natural persons refer to individuals who may be victims or offenders assessed by AI systems for criminal activities.</data>
