      <data key="d0">Legal Person</data>
      <data key="d1">AIDeployer</data>
      <data key="d2">A legal person is an entity such as a corporation or organization that may also be classified as a deployer of an AI system.&lt;SEP&gt;Legal Person is an entity, such as a corporation or organization, that can have legal rights and responsibilities, including holding editorial control.</data>
