      <data key="d1">AICapability</data>
      <data key="d2">Cybersecurity measures are protective protocols instituted to safeguard sensitive information surrounding AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Cybersecurity measures comprise technical solutions designed to protect high-risk AI systems from unauthorized alterations that could impact their functionality and performance.</data>
