      <data key="d1">Regulation</data>
      <data key="d2">Directive (EU) 2020/1828 concerns representative actions for the protection of collective consumer interests, introduced by the European Parliament and Council.&lt;SEP&gt;Directive (EU) 2020/1828 governs certain legislative aspects related to data use and access in the EU.&lt;SEP&gt;Directive (EU) 2020/1828 is addressed in Regulation (EU) 2023/988 and affects safety requirements for products.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f182220530b59a4450fc951016283bfc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3f7d41ecd7ed7ec26e62e63255378cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6485ea34e7fea16b2f5a59242c8ef2a6</data>
