    <node id="Artificial Intelligence Act">
      <data key="d0">Artificial Intelligence Act</data>
      <data key="d1">Regulation</data>
      <data key="d2">The Artificial Intelligence Act (Regulation (EU) 2024/1689) lays down harmonised rules on artificial intelligence within the EU, aiming to regulate AI technologies and their applications.&lt;SEP&gt;The Artificial Intelligence Act is a legislative proposal concerning the regulation of artificial intelligence technologies and systems within the EU.&lt;SEP&gt;The Artificial Intelligence Act is a proposed regulation establishing comprehensive regulations for AI technologies in the EU, including risk assessments and compliance.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7eb5283f4e280f1ec77650d624699286&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6485ea34e7fea16b2f5a59242c8ef2a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a68b7c657291244b183bd644e6df395</data>
