    <node id="European Union">
      <data key="d0">European Union</data>
      <data key="d1">LocalityOfUse</data>
      <data key="d2">The European Union is a political and economic union of Member States that are required to harmonise legislative measures like those stated in Directive 2014/32/EU.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Union is a political and economic union of member states in Europe, under which the document OJ L 409 was published.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Union is a political and economic union of member states that have established regulations regarding AI systems and standards.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Union is a political and economic union where AI systems can be deployed and circulate across member states.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ae8bdbb57af24d78fe2313201571bea7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f41337092de45470ab838aff17309ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4fa1ad79284c6e1a9636113352a8e0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39c5673a732c92c4eea89527b9e2e10b</data>
