      <data key="d0">Requirements in Section 2</data>
      <data key="d1">Regulation</data>
      <data key="d2">Requirements in Section 2 detail specific expectations related to high-risk AI systems and their compliance obligations.&lt;SEP&gt;Requirements in Section 2 outline the compliance obligations that providers must fulfill for their high-risk AI systems to operate legally in the market.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-68d6983d829937a84d37118dacc3e39c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c17bf6e803eec807c9fc7299d71d51d6</data>
