    </node>
    <node id="Long-Term Impacts">
      <data key="d0">Long-Term Impacts</data>
      <data key="d1">Consequence</data>
      <data key="d2">Long-term impacts refer to the enduring effects that AI technologies may have on individuals, society, and the environment.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-256a6003a5841f2764536c55f7086431</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_27.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750859455</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Diversity, Non-discrimination, and Fairness">
      <data key="d0">Diversity, Non-discrimination, and Fairness</data>
      <data key="d1">QualityMeasurement</data>
      <data key="d2">This principle involves developing AI systems that include diverse actors and promote equality, avoiding biases and ensuring compliance with laws.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-849f8f0403e6b12fa8a9c24b84c094c7</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_27.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750859455</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Social and Environmental Well-being">
      <data key="d0">Social and Environmental Well-being</data>
      <data key="d1">QualityMeasurement</data>
      <data key="d2">This principle promotes the sustainable and environmentally friendly use of AI systems to benefit humanity while assessing long-term impacts.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-849f8f0403e6b12fa8a9c24b84c094c7</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_27.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750859455</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Harm Minimization">
      <data key="d0">Harm Minimization</data>
      <data key="d1">QualityMeasurement</data>
      <data key="d2">Harm minimization entails developing AI systems that reduce unintended consequences and protect individuals from risks associated with technology.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-849f8f0403e6b12fa8a9c24b84c094c7</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_27.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750859455</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Explainability">
      <data key="d0">Explainability</data>
      <data key="d1">QualityMeasurement</data>
      <data key="d2">Explainability involves ensuring AI systems provide understandable outputs and the rationale behind their decisions to users and affected parties.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-849f8f0403e6b12fa8a9c24b84c094c7</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_27.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750859455</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Voluntary Best Practices">
      <data key="d0">Voluntary Best Practices</data>
      <data key="d1">Standard</data>
      <data key="d2">Voluntary best practices refer to guidelines that organizations are encouraged to develop and adopt to promote ethical conduct and effectiveness.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-54c5e21ac6860a002561ead75c49b95b</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_27.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750859455</data>
