      <data key="d0">Integration into Software</data>
      <data key="d1">AICapability</data>
      <data key="d2">Integration into Software refers to the ability of AI components to be embedded within existing software applications to enhance their functionality.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7963b30391bfa3d5e28ecd9a95b61010</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_88.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750859558</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Written Agreement">
      <data key="d0">Written Agreement</data>
      <data key="d1">Documentation</data>
      <data key="d2">A Written Agreement is a formal contract that outlines the responsibilities and obligations of parties involved in providing AI services and components.&lt;SEP&gt;A written agreement defines the roles and responsibilities of all parties involved in the testing of AI systems, aiding in clarity and compliance.&lt;SEP&gt;A written agreement defines the roles and responsibilities of prospective AI providers and deployers involved in real-world testing.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ad1a115533e7d3b3ced9ea8e2e87b0e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8022b105f5e7e2d0ba74bbe75f31f87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7963b30391bfa3d5e28ecd9a95b61010</data>
