    <node id="Model Lifecycle">
      <data key="d0">Model Lifecycle</data>
      <data key="d1">AILifecyclePhase</data>
      <data key="d2">The model lifecycle encompasses all stages of an AI model's existence, from development to deployment, which can be sources of risk.&lt;SEP&gt;The model lifecycle encompasses the entire duration of an AI model's existence, from development through deployment and monitoring.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b3f46abe104a1bdb0fae1c25094db36d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-447d51c65bac6d28fd62c36c3e70e08b</data>
