    </node>
    <node id="EU General Budget">
      <data key="d0">EU General Budget</data>
      <data key="d1">Data</data>
      <data key="d2">The EU General Budget is impacted by funds collected from administrative fines, contributing to its overall financial framework.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-111c71f234a0f2d1b26490907acae6eb</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_100.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750859985</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Union Institution, Body, Office or Agency">
      <data key="d0">Union Institution, Body, Office or Agency</data>
      <data key="d1">AISubject</data>
      <data key="d2">The Union institution, body, office or agency refers to various entities within the European Union that must adhere to regulations set forth in data protection laws.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-111c71f234a0f2d1b26490907acae6eb</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_100.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750859985</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Non-compliance">
      <data key="d0">Non-compliance</data>
      <data key="d1">Risk</data>
      <data key="d2">Non-compliance refers to failing to meet the obligations outlined in the Regulation concerning AI practices, leading to imposed penalties.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-111c71f234a0f2d1b26490907acae6eb</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_100.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750859985</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Right to be Heard">
      <data key="d0">Right to be Heard</data>
      <data key="d1">QualityMeasurement</data>
      <data key="d2">The Right to be Heard allows parties involved in proceedings with the European Data Protection Supervisor to present their case before decisions are made.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-111c71f234a0f2d1b26490907acae6eb</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_100.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750859985</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Effective Operation">
      <data key="d0">Effective Operation</data>
      <data key="d1">QualityMeasurement</data>
      <data key="d2">Effective Operation refers to the ability of Union institutions to function without impairment due to financial penalties imposed.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-111c71f234a0f2d1b26490907acae6eb</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_100.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750859985</data>
    </node>
    <node id="General Budget of the Union">
      <data key="d0">General Budget of the Union</data>
      <data key="d1">Data</data>
      <data key="d2">The General Budget of the Union includes funds collected from administrative fines, affecting overall financial resources.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-111c71f234a0f2d1b26490907acae6eb</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_100.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750859985</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Data Protection Supervisor">
      <data key="d0">Data Protection Supervisor</data>
      <data key="d1">AIDeployer</data>
      <data key="d2">The Data Protection Supervisor is responsible for overseeing data protection regulations and ensuring compliance with the law.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-828a2d9070cae319b764e3b609bc9b81</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_100.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750859985</data>
    </node>
    <node id="business secrets">
      <data key="d0">business secrets</data>
      <data key="d1">Data</data>
      <data key="d2">Business secrets involve confidential business information that provides a competitive edge and must be protected legally.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-828a2d9070cae319b764e3b609bc9b81</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_100.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750859985</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Union Budget">
      <data key="d0">Union Budget</data>
      <data key="d1">Dimension</data>
      <data key="d2">The Union Budget refers to the financial plan of the Union, which is supported by funds collected from various sources, including fines.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-828a2d9070cae319b764e3b609bc9b81</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_100.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750859985</data>
    </node>
    <node id="legitimate interest">
      <data key="d0">legitimate interest</data>
      <data key="d1">QualityMeasurement</data>
      <data key="d2">Legitimate interest refers to a legal basis for processing personal data, ensuring that individuals’ rights are respected while allowing data processing under certain conditions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-828a2d9070cae319b764e3b609bc9b81</data>
