    <node id="Personal Data Protection">
      <data key="d0">Personal Data Protection</data>
      <data key="d1">Regulation</data>
      <data key="d2">Personal Data Protection regulations outline the obligations and rights surrounding the processing of personal data, influencing how high-risk AI systems operate.&lt;SEP&gt;Personal data protection involves safeguarding individuals' data, ensuring it is deleted when consent is withdrawn, and adhering to legal regulations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c852bda35515c8d5385ef007c8140254&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad1a115533e7d3b3ced9ea8e2e87b0e2</data>
