      <data key="d1">AreaOfImpact</data>
      <data key="d2">The EU represents a significant area of impact concerning regulations on data governance and access within its member states.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Union (EU) is a political and economic union of member states that are located primarily in Europe, influencing regulations such as Regulation (EU) 2019/1020.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f182220530b59a4450fc951016283bfc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40de45b5b0c24b78b7ef2ca4e835c29c</data>
