      <data key="d1">CodeOfConduct</data>
      <data key="d2">Obligations of deployers are the specific requirements they must fulfill to comply with regulations when employing AI technologies, including transparency responsibilities.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0044fdddd0a21caecd46a12639588d98</data>
