      <data key="d0">Regulation (EU) No 526/2013</data>
      <data key="d1">Regulation</data>
      <data key="d2">Regulation (EU) No 526/2013, known as the Cybersecurity Act, was the previous legislative framework governing cybersecurity before being replaced by Regulation (EU) 2019/881.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9ec0d2d3cbe2a53a3bbf6373c775edf2</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_78.json</data>
