      <data key="d0">Qualified Alerts</data>
      <data key="d1">Consequence</data>
      <data key="d2">Qualified Alerts are notifications issued by the scientific panel to indicate potential risks associated with AI models that require further investigation.&lt;SEP&gt;Qualified Alerts are notifications or warnings issued to alert the AI Office of AI models that may require closer scrutiny due to potential systemic risks.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3a0c1908573a7d6a832a6b35befbd7ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ec7c9ce58b650afe456517c2483e56c</data>
