      <data key="d1">Dimension</data>
      <data key="d2">The right to privacy ensures that individuals have control over their personal data and its usage throughout the AI lifecycle.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7d18c3755735a13a436e766a5ca73fc4</data>
