    </node>
    <node id="Relevant Facts">
      <data key="d0">Relevant Facts</data>
      <data key="d1">Data</data>
      <data key="d2">Relevant Facts include the information considered by the scientific panel when issuing a qualified alert regarding AI models.&lt;SEP&gt;Relevant facts are the specific details and circumstances that justify the complaint lodged by downstream providers.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-140dff8b8263721e25ea86a4104c273d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18d33fd192f06f727ac6bb21becbaa57</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_89.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_90.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750862426</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Notification Process">
      <data key="d0">Notification Process</data>
      <data key="d1">Process</data>
      <data key="d2">The Notification Process is a phase in which alerts and actions are communicated between the scientific panel and the AI Office.&lt;SEP&gt;The notification process involves informing the AI Office of a general-purpose AI model meeting specific requirements or risks.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-140dff8b8263721e25ea86a4104c273d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fb0ee5d200ca5b71eb6d9f53ad070ef</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_112.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_90.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750863246</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Subcontractor">
      <data key="d0">Subcontractor</data>
      <data key="d1">AIDeveloper</data>
      <data key="d2">A subcontractor is an individual or business that carries out work for a company as part of a larger project.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9f55b689ece7aa049c38fdc38018dba8</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_33.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750861593</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Subsidiary">
      <data key="d0">Subsidiary</data>
      <data key="d1">AIDeveloper</data>
      <data key="d2">A subsidiary is a company controlled by a parent company, which can execute specific tasks under a notified body.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9f55b689ece7aa049c38fdc38018dba8</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_33.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750861593</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Regulation Article 31">
      <data key="d0">Regulation Article 31</data>
      <data key="d1">Regulation</data>
      <data key="d2">Article 31 outlines the requirements that must be met by subcontractors or subsidiaries engaged by notified bodies.</data>
