    </node>
    <node id="Provider Agreement">
      <data key="d0">Provider Agreement</data>
      <data key="d1">AIDeployer</data>
      <data key="d2">The provider agreement is a contractual document that outlines the terms under which subcontractors or subsidiaries may perform tasks for notified bodies.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9f55b689ece7aa049c38fdc38018dba8</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_33.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750861593</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Assessment Documentation">
      <data key="d0">Assessment Documentation</data>
      <data key="d1">Documentation</data>
      <data key="d2">Assessment documentation includes records of the qualifications and work performed by subcontractors and subsidiaries.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9f55b689ece7aa049c38fdc38018dba8</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_33.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750861593</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Five-Year Record Keeping Requirement">
      <data key="d0">Five-Year Record Keeping Requirement</data>
      <data key="d1">Regulation</data>
      <data key="d2">The five-year record-keeping requirement mandates that documents related to the assessment of subcontractors must be retained for five years.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9f55b689ece7aa049c38fdc38018dba8</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_33.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750861593</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Article 17">
      <data key="d0">Article 17</data>
      <data key="d1">DocumentSection</data>
      <data key="d2">Article 17 of Regulation (EU) 2018/1139 pertains to the implementing acts regarding AI systems categorized as safety components.&lt;SEP&gt;Article 17 specifies the requirements for a quality management system that may be simplified for microenterprises, allowing them to comply without affecting safety standards.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d7805654ce0fe0d8d9b6ba008562d2aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e4f07f79ad3c90c82b86c0a02d0fae9</data>
