      <data key="d0">Articles 9-15, 72, and 73</data>
      <data key="d1">Regulation</data>
      <data key="d2">These articles outline the additional requirements and obligations that microenterprises must comply with under the regulation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6e4f07f79ad3c90c82b86c0a02d0fae9</data>
