    <node id="General-purpose AI models">
      <data key="d0">General-purpose AI models</data>
      <data key="d1">AIModel</data>
      <data key="d2">General-purpose AI models are versatile AI systems that can be applied to a wide range of tasks, often needing to conform to specified standards for safety and performance.&lt;SEP&gt;General-purpose AI models, especially large generative models, are capable of producing text, images, and various forms of content, providing innovative opportunities and challenges in creative fields.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5429fed5961ecea1e5eed049e922476f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2739984aae71aa27a0af867bc197b730</data>
