      <data key="d1">Change</data>
      <data key="d2">Corrective Action refers to the measures that must be taken by operators to mitigate risks associated with AI systems in compliance with regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Corrective action refers to measures taken by the provider to address identified risks or issues following a serious incident.&lt;SEP&gt;Corrective action refers to the measures taken by the provider to address the serious incident and mitigate its effects.&lt;SEP&gt;Corrective action refers to steps taken by the provider to rectify compliance failures regarding AI systems.</data>
