    <node id="Technical Redundancy Solutions">
      <data key="d0">Technical Redundancy Solutions</data>
      <data key="d1">AICapability</data>
      <data key="d2">Technical redundancy solutions are measures implemented to enhance the resilience of AI systems against errors and faults, including the provision of backup or fail-safe plans.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-671e76af4a78aebc96c988f0504bfa99</data>
