    <node id="Data Poisoning">
      <data key="d0">Data Poisoning</data>
      <data key="d1">Misuse</data>
      <data key="d2">Data poisoning involves manipulating training datasets to compromise the integrity of AI models.&lt;SEP&gt;Data poisoning refers to malicious attempts to manipulate the training data set of AI systems, compromising their integrity and reliability.&lt;SEP&gt;Data poisoning is a specific type of attack where poisonous data is introduced into training datasets to corrupt the learning process.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-671e76af4a78aebc96c988f0504bfa99&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed5ccbca443324af303d8bca3aa31a38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5765a06abb615496a937c9303e1583cd</data>
