      <data key="d1">Dimension</data>
      <data key="d2">Technical aspects encompass the necessary considerations and standards for designing high-risk AI systems to ensure optimal performance.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-671e76af4a78aebc96c988f0504bfa99</data>
