      <data key="d1">High-Risk Product</data>
      <data key="d2">Medical devices are classified as high-risk under regulation, especially those enhanced or operated using AI technologies.&lt;SEP&gt;Medical devices are products used for medical purposes, which need conformity assessment according to specific regulations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-70555b8168fcbd401cc11093ec15091a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ab1f3b6cbb052c58ff3b9fc75a6d7a2</data>
