    </node>
    <node id="Workers">
      <data key="d0">Workers</data>
      <data key="d1">AISubject</data>
      <data key="d2">Workers are individuals affected by the deployment of high-risk AI systems, whose rights and conditions are protected under relevant labor laws.&lt;SEP&gt;Workers are individuals employed in various sectors who have rights to be informed about AI system deployments affecting their work.&lt;SEP&gt;Workers are individuals whose rights and working conditions are protected under Union law when affected by AI systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9bece07e296fce9647a40a0dde904fe4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c664ec81872dda212b64d449aa7a2014&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c28a81721b7de3ef4442495cc499b1cb</data>
