      <data key="d1">Documentation</data>
      <data key="d2">The Objection Notification is a formal communication process that takes place in the event of disagreement regarding compliance measures for AI systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-28daf57045ce50f0bd160cddd41ffc14</data>
