      <data key="d1">Regulation</data>
      <data key="d2">A Provisional Measure is a temporary compliance action taken by the market surveillance authority to address immediate concerns regarding an AI system.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-28daf57045ce50f0bd160cddd41ffc14</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_79.json</data>
