    <node id="Market Placement">
      <data key="d0">Market Placement</data>
      <data key="d1">AIDeployer</data>
      <data key="d2">Market Placement refers to the various ways in which General-Purpose AI Models can be made available to users, including APIs and libraries.&lt;SEP&gt;Market placement refers to how an AI model is positioned in the market and its accessibility to users, impacting its risk profile.&lt;SEP&gt;Market placement refers to how and where general-purpose AI models are deployed, impacting their evaluation for systemic risks.</data>
