      <data key="d1">AISubject</data>
      <data key="d2">Financial Institutions are organizations like banks and investment firms that are governed by Union financial services law regarding their operational and governance standards.&lt;SEP&gt;Financial Institutions are providers required to maintain logs as part of their governance under Union financial services law.&lt;SEP&gt;Financial institutions that deploy AI systems must comply with specific internal governance and documentation regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Organizations that deploy AI systems and are subject to specific governance requirements under Union financial services law.</data>
