    </node>
    <node id="Rights of Data Subjects">
      <data key="d0">Rights of Data Subjects</data>
      <data key="d1">Regulation</data>
      <data key="d2">Rights of data subjects are the protections afforded to individuals regarding their personal data under GDPR and other relevant regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Rights of data subjects include the right to access, rectify, delete, and restrict the processing of their personal data.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-85605aee8aaac2bf4ad29d80d902148f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a46250ea72037444e96653239f2893b2</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_10.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_140.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750863342</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Data Controllers">
      <data key="d0">Data Controllers</data>
      <data key="d1">AIDeployer</data>
      <data key="d2">Data controllers are entities that determine the purposes and means of processing personal data and must comply with relevant regulations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-85605aee8aaac2bf4ad29d80d902148f</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_10.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750862268</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Data Processors">
      <data key="d0">Data Processors</data>
      <data key="d1">AIDeveloper</data>
      <data key="d2">Data processors are entities that process personal data on behalf of the data controllers according to legal requirements.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-85605aee8aaac2bf4ad29d80d902148f</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_10.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750862268</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Data Subjects Rights">
      <data key="d0">Data Subjects Rights</data>
      <data key="d1">QualityMeasurement</data>
      <data key="d2">Data subjects’ rights encompass the protections and guarantees provided to individuals regarding their personal data under Union law.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-15eee417af0ebe299ed66be76a0b845a</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_10.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750862268</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Rights">
      <data key="d0">Rights</data>
      <data key="d1">QualityMeasurement</data>
      <data key="d2">Rights refer to the legal entitlements granted to individuals under Union law, safeguarding their interests in relation to personal data.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-15eee417af0ebe299ed66be76a0b845a</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_10.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750862268</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Automated Individual Decision-Making">
      <data key="d0">Automated Individual Decision-Making</data>
      <data key="d1">AICapability</data>
      <data key="d2">Automated individual decision-making encompasses processes where decisions are made without human intervention, often using algorithms or AI systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-15eee417af0ebe299ed66be76a0b845a</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_10.json</data>
