      <data key="d0">Council Framework Decision 2008/977/JHA</data>
      <data key="d1">Regulation</data>
      <data key="d2">The Council Framework Decision 2008/977/JHA was repealed by Directive (EU) 2016/680 and relates to the processing of personal data for law enforcement.</data>
