      <data key="d1">DocumentSection</data>
      <data key="d2">Article 58 details the protocol for adopting delegated acts regarding AI systems identified as safety components.&lt;SEP&gt;Article 58 of Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 provides additional procedural requirements related to AI systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d7805654ce0fe0d8d9b6ba008562d2aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4219a2a10d85ddd82f98b8d6267cb9b</data>
