      <data key="d2">AI Providers must meet specific obligations defined by regulations to ensure ethical and responsible use of their models.&lt;SEP&gt;An individual or organization that offers AI systems and is responsible for their safe development and testing.&lt;SEP&gt;An AI provider is an entity or organization that develops and supplies AI models, like general-purpose models, to clients or consumers.</data>
