      <data key="d1">QualityMeasurement</data>
      <data key="d2">Rights and freedoms encompass the fundamental entitlements and liberties that individuals possess, which the Regulation seeks to safeguard in relation to AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The rights and freedoms of individuals are measured concerning the impact of AI systems on their privacy and personal liberties.&lt;SEP&gt;Rights and freedoms pertain to the individual rights that need to be safeguarded when implementing biometric identification systems in public areas.</data>
