      <data key="d1">AICapability</data>
      <data key="d2">Evaluation of learning outcomes is a process where AI assesses the achievements and comprehension levels of learners.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7df88d0d68bb9e14cc05c3f581da8399</data>
