      <data key="d0">Article 90(1)</data>
      <data key="d1">Regulation</data>
      <data key="d2">Article 90(1) outlines the procedures through which the Commission can designate models based on systemic risks as well as the process for reassessment.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c1ef1c9ca92c002cf6ad36264fe1292c</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_52.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750862920</data>
