      <data key="d0">intellectual property rights</data>
      <data key="d1">Regulation</data>
      <data key="d2">Intellectual property rights are legal protections granted to creators and inventors to secure ownership and control over their inventions and creations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-fe4d7c8b1c65cb7b9f5021681b13c271</data>
