      <data key="d1">AISubject</data>
      <data key="d2">Persons with disabilities are a vulnerable group defined under EU regulations who may be at risk of being exploited due to AI practices.&lt;SEP&gt;Persons with disabilities are individuals who have long-term physical, mental, intellectual, or sensory impairments, which can hinder their full participation in society.</data>
