      <data key="d1">AreaOfImpact</data>
      <data key="d2">Public trust is the confidence the community has in law enforcement authorities and their use of technology, which must be maintained even with AI.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-bbcf833252ce65fd6a1d8bd1f5a6efc1</data>
