      <data key="d1">AIComponent</data>
      <data key="d2">AI tools are specialized technologies used in various law enforcement applications for predictive analytics and decision making.&lt;SEP&gt;AI tools are technologies implemented by various authorities, including law enforcement, for tasks related to crime detection and prevention.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-bbcf833252ce65fd6a1d8bd1f5a6efc1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77ba8e0dd4981bd71dedb04a86b45601</data>
