      <data key="d2">A Legal Representative is an individual or entity appointed to act on behalf of a provider or prospective provider within the EU framework.&lt;SEP&gt;The legal representative is a person who may act on behalf of the subjects of testing, particularly regarding their rights and consent.</data>
