    <node id="Article 16 TFEU">
      <data key="d0">Article 16 TFEU</data>
      <data key="d1">Regulation</data>
      <data key="d2">Article 16 TFEU concerns the protection of individuals in the context of data processing related to AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Article 16 TFEU outlines rules related to the protection of personal data and privacy, forming the basis for the Regulation on AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Article 16 TFEU provides a legal framework regarding the protection of personal data, used to inform the Regulation on biometric processing.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d1b92a727425c41637e16da3cb9ac9c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae8bdbb57af24d78fe2313201571bea7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee1f186f5aed070bc8e6e813caed9967</data>
