    <node id="Regulations (EC) No 300/2008, (EU) No 167/2013, (EU) No 168/2013, (EU) 2018/858, (EU) 2018/1139, (EU) 2019/2144">
      <data key="d0">Regulations (EC) No 300/2008, (EU) No 167/2013, (EU) No 168/2013, (EU) 2018/858, (EU) 2018/1139, (EU) 2019/2144</data>
      <data key="d1">Regulation</data>
      <data key="d2">These are various regulations that were amended by Regulation (EU) 2024/1689, indicating a comprehensive framework governing multiple aspects of AI and related technologies.</data>
