    <node id="Trade Secrets">
      <data key="d0">Trade Secrets</data>
      <data key="d1">Vulnerability</data>
      <data key="d2">Trade secrets are classified information that must be treated with confidentiality as per the obligations set in the regulation.&lt;SEP&gt;Trade secrets are confidential business information that must be protected under confidentiality obligations.&lt;SEP&gt;Trade secrets are practices, designs, formulas, processes, or any information that provides a business advantage over competitors.&lt;SEP&gt;Trade secrets are confidential business information that must be protected and not disclosed in the training data summary to uphold competitive advantage.</data>
