      <data key="d1">AIComponent</data>
      <data key="d2">The Standing Subgroup for Market Surveillance acts as an administrative cooperation group under the Regulation for coordinating efforts among authorities.&lt;SEP&gt;The Standing Subgroup for Market Surveillance is established to focus on specific market evaluation tasks.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d4058e2567f154203a2d9dacec4bdf7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aacbea1ddddc58fbf14c882b36d9a6b3</data>
