      <data key="d1">QualityMeasurement</data>
      <data key="d2">Market Evaluations are undertaken by the Commission to identify and address coordination aspects needed for the Regulation.&lt;SEP&gt;Market Evaluations involve studying the market to identify compliance issues and ensure effective regulation.</data>
