      <data key="d0">Paragraph 1</data>
      <data key="d1">Documentation</data>
      <data key="d2">Paragraph 1 outlines the requirement for providers to establish and document a post-market monitoring system in relation to high-risk AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Paragraph 1 refers to the section of legislation that establishes the scope of authority and responsibilities of national public authorities involved in information collection.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f56b40e98f8949a37c3ab283b01f7050&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8512760339eb776d946a91a28089b34</data>
