    <node id="Certificates">
      <data key="d0">Certificates</data>
      <data key="d1">QualityMeasurement</data>
      <data key="d2">Certificates are formal documents issued by notified bodies to confirm that an AI system meets specific regulatory requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;Certificates are issued by notified bodies to indicate compliance, which may be suspended or withdrawn under certain conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Certificates are official documents issued by notified bodies affirming that a product meets specific regulatory requirements after assessment.&lt;SEP&gt;Certificates are official documents issued by notified bodies to signify compliance with regulations for AI systems and are valid for a specified period.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8caee37338a6383c30fe06ea2b3e4761&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34f79a9fca1518856b24fdcb7e59f040&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cdf6e3e080867f88ec52fa9fabbeafd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-397d6e2474c4f45e883f265653f2e715</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_36.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_44.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750863782</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Validity Period">
      <data key="d0">Validity Period</data>
      <data key="d1">Dimension</data>
      <data key="d2">The validity period refers to the duration for which a certificate remains effective, as specified for AI systems covered by Annex I and Annex III.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-397d6e2474c4f45e883f265653f2e715</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_44.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750863231</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Suspension">
      <data key="d0">Suspension</data>
      <data key="d1">Change</data>
      <data key="d2">Suspension refers to the action taken by a notified body when an AI system no longer meets compliance requirements, leading to the potential withdrawal of a certificate.&lt;SEP&gt;Suspension refers to the temporary halt of activities related to a notified body or a certificate, impacting its validity and monitoring capabilities.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-cdf6e3e080867f88ec52fa9fabbeafd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-397d6e2474c4f45e883f265653f2e715</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_36.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_44.json</data>
