      <data key="d1">AISystem</data>
      <data key="d2">The data processing environment in the sandbox is isolated and controlled to ensure the secure handling of personal data during development and testing.&lt;SEP&gt;The data processing environment refers to the isolated setting where personal data is processed securely, ensuring it is protected from unauthorized access.</data>
