      <data key="d0">Illustrative Examples</data>
      <data key="d1">Data</data>
      <data key="d2">Illustrative examples are practical illustrations included in the instructions of use to help clarify the functioning and limitations of AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Illustrative examples are practical scenarios included in the instructions for use to clarify limitations and appropriate uses of the AI system.</data>
