    <node id="Migration">
      <data key="d0">Migration</data>
      <data key="d1">AreaOfImpact</data>
      <data key="d2">Migration involves the movement of individuals from one place to another, prompting verification in border control and asylum contexts.&lt;SEP&gt;Migration is a designated high-risk area where AI systems may be implemented and thus subject to registration requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;Migration represents an area where high-risk AI systems are relevant, particularly where AI might impact individuals' rights and freedoms.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ded7b0ac022304fae10651966b33d18c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ed67e673a6fe0a3c79a41bb9102d44b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2806e288e0b71013209c4ad85ecaa38b</data>
