    <node id="Asylum">
      <data key="d0">Asylum</data>
      <data key="d1">AreaOfImpact</data>
      <data key="d2">Asylum is another area of high-risk for AI systems indicating unique registration and compliance measures.&lt;SEP&gt;Asylum pertains to the area of human rights, where decisions made by high-risk AI systems can dramatically affect individuals seeking refuge.&lt;SEP&gt;Asylum refers to the protection granted to individuals fleeing their home country due to persecution, which necessitates verification requirements in certain contexts.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ded7b0ac022304fae10651966b33d18c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ed67e673a6fe0a3c79a41bb9102d44b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2806e288e0b71013209c4ad85ecaa38b</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_73.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_131.json</data>
