      <data key="d1">AICapability</data>
      <data key="d2">A risk management system is a structured process for identifying, analyzing, and mitigating risks associated with high-risk AI systems throughout their lifecycle.&lt;SEP&gt;The risk management system encompasses the overall framework for identifying, assessing, and mitigating risks associated with high-risk AI systems.</data>
