      <data key="d1">Hazard</data>
      <data key="d2">A hazard is a source of potential harm or adverse effect that may arise from the use of high-risk AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;A hazard refers to a potential source of harm or adverse effect associated with the use of high-risk AI systems that necessitates risk management.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a68b9cb2eff595118d2af9313b6c89f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ca7c773df7242c37f506b8ad3db475b</data>
