      <data key="d1">Risk</data>
      <data key="d2">Residual risk is the risk remaining after risk management measures have been implemented, requiring evaluation to be deemed acceptable.&lt;SEP&gt;Residual risk refers to the risk remaining after risk management measures have been applied to high-risk AI systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a68b9cb2eff595118d2af9313b6c89f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ca7c773df7242c37f506b8ad3db475b</data>
