      <data key="d1">Change</data>
      <data key="d2">Risk management measures are actions taken to mitigate or control identified risks in high-risk AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Risk management measures are strategies implemented to minimize risks associated with high-risk AI systems, including mitigation and control measures.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a68b9cb2eff595118d2af9313b6c89f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ca7c773df7242c37f506b8ad3db475b</data>
