      <data key="d0">conformity assessment</data>
      <data key="d1">QualityMeasurement</data>
      <data key="d2">Conformity assessment is the process by which notified bodies evaluate whether high-risk AI systems comply with regulatory requirements based on the documentation provided.</data>
