      <data key="d0">Provider of the System</data>
      <data key="d1">AIDeployer</data>
      <data key="d2">The Provider of the System refers to the entity or organization responsible for deploying AI systems that require certification and oversight by the authorities.&lt;SEP&gt;The provider of the system is the entity responsible for the high-risk AI system and must communicate changes regarding certification status to competent authorities.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b341fa074527a308a2434a3c68244d02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cdf6e3e080867f88ec52fa9fabbeafd6</data>
