      <data key="d1">AICapability</data>
      <data key="d2">Functions of the Notified Body encompass the responsibilities assigned for evaluating AI systems and determining their compliance with applicable regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;The functions of the notified body refer to the responsibilities and capabilities involved in evaluating and monitoring AI system compliance.</data>
