      <data key="d0">Provisional Validity</data>
      <data key="d1">QualityMeasurement</data>
      <data key="d2">Provisional Validity represents a temporary retention of certification validity during transitions or changes in designation status, typically limited to a set duration.&lt;SEP&gt;Provisional validity refers to the temporary status granted to certificates in exceptional situations where compliance concerns have been resolved.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b341fa074527a308a2434a3c68244d02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cdf6e3e080867f88ec52fa9fabbeafd6</data>
