      <data key="d1">Change</data>
      <data key="d2">Designation refers to the formal recognition of an organization or its system under regulatory frameworks, allowing it to operate within specified guidelines.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b341fa074527a308a2434a3c68244d02</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_36.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750863801</data>
