      <data key="d0">Withdrawal of the Designation</data>
      <data key="d1">Consequence</data>
      <data key="d2">Withdrawal of the Designation signals the revocation of an organization's regulatory approval, impacting its ability to operate or offer services.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b341fa074527a308a2434a3c68244d02</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_36.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1750863801</data>
    </node>
