    <edge source="Regulation" target="AI System">
      <data key="d6">82.0</data>
      <data key="d7">AI systems must adhere to the obligations set forth in the Regulation when their models are placed on the market.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI System is classified under specific conditions laid out in the Regulation concerning its risk level.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI System is mandated to operate within the guidelines established by the Regulation to ensure its compliant usage across various contexts. This Regulation governs the use and data processing of AI systems, particularly regarding their deployment across borders, with the aim of protecting individuals' rights. It sets forth rules that necessitate AI systems to meet compliance standards before they are made available in the Union. Specifically, Article 3 of the Regulation includes definitions and requirements that are directly applicable to AI systems. The regulation not only governs the implementation of the AI System but also addresses risks associated with its influence on decision-making. Additionally, it outlines the operational framework for AI systems, especially in relation to high-risk applications, thereby detailing the compliance requirements necessary for lawful operation.&lt;SEP&gt;The classification of an AI system as high-risk is governed by the Regulation, which outlines compliance requirements.</data>
      <data key="d8">AI governance,classification criteria,compliance,compliance guideline,data protection,enforcement,governance,legal compliance,legal definition,legal oversight,regulation,regulatory compliance,regulatory framework,risk classification,risk management</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-a64bfb94635a0df2f808b2f8a494bd3e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b235644744fa597c94328afbeaa7e56b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1eea61d03ab615ac5f518e77cd220c1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ffa7662f1a996e8ed97ec3caf0ae564&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e78bce1eaa5df9c186492b5e1482218&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4672fd3df7077626af67d20e46d3fcb4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fc29985a43f3bd521b3a1c9eb9ba756&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b89491b02af0a00cbc13f9e8df827a6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5fb48082255c480535475ddb098366a</data>
      <data key="d10">./cached_docs/recital_82.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_96.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_63.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_53.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_80.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_22.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_97.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_24.json</data>
      <data key="d11">1750863931</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Regulation" target="Market">
      <data key="d6">17.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Market is shaped and governed by the Regulation that establishes compliance requirements for AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The Market operates within the framework set by the Regulation, which dictates how AI technologies can be developed and deployed.</data>
      <data key="d8">market dynamics,market governance,regulatory framework,regulatory impact</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-ba662546e18e6e5f82c3cd1c5b4c3b75&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fc29985a43f3bd521b3a1c9eb9ba756</data>
