      <data key="d11">1750857432</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Regulation" target="AI systems">
      <data key="d6">37.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Regulation establishes rules that specifically govern the deployment and use of AI systems across jurisdictions.&lt;SEP&gt;The Regulation stipulates that various obligations apply to providers and deployers of AI systems operating within the Union.&lt;SEP&gt;The Regulation imposes requirements on AI systems to ensure they operate within set legal frameworks in the Union.&lt;SEP&gt;The Regulation governs the use and deployment of AI systems within the internal market to ensure safety and compliance.</data>
      <data key="d8">AI governance,compliance,legal framework,regulation,regulatory compliance,regulatory framework</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-63ef16386f45c7bc364061cc094254fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cac929d0048fe34377179e8ecde4a5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5928be36056ac91865bd3e4d596159e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13991bdab077b3114e8913f89a1371e5</data>
      <data key="d10">./cached_docs/article_1.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_2.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_118.json</data>
      <data key="d11">1750863598</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Regulation" target="general-purpose AI models">
      <data key="d6">24.0</data>
      <data key="d7">General-purpose AI models must comply with regulatory obligations established for their market presence.&lt;SEP&gt;The Regulation includes provisions for general-purpose AI models to ensure their safe market placement in the Union.&lt;SEP&gt;The Regulation establishes rules for the market entry of general-purpose AI models to ensure public safety and trust.</data>
      <data key="d8">AI compliance,compliance,market regulation,market rules,regulatory framework</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-47ce3f90343791af10ffae2a7848f26e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5928be36056ac91865bd3e4d596159e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13991bdab077b3114e8913f89a1371e5</data>
