    <edge source="Regulation" target="AI Systems">
      <data key="d6">109.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Regulation serves as a comprehensive framework governing the use of AI Systems, particularly in the contexts of biometric identification, law enforcement, military, and security applications. It establishes specific requirements and safeguards designed to mitigate risks to individual rights and health, ensuring that the deployment of AI Systems is both lawful and compliant with ethical standards as stipulated by the Union.

Under this Regulation, the permissible use of AI Systems for biometric identification in publicly accessible spaces for law enforcement purposes is clearly outlined. It mandates that AI Systems must provide transparent and accurate outputs, with effective measures in place for detecting discrepancies. The Regulation also categorizes AI Systems, differentiating between high-risk and non-high-risk models and applying stringent rules for the use of the former.

Additionally, the Regulation emphasizes the importance of informing workers about the deployment of high-risk AI Systems, thereby safeguarding their rights and freedoms. It includes specific provisions regarding the application of AI Systems in scientific research, noting certain exclusions. Overall, the Regulation is designed to ensure that AI Systems operate within established legal parameters, fostering a secure and principled approach to technology usage within the Union.&lt;SEP&gt;The Regulation sets specific requirements and obligations for AI systems, impacting their operation and compliance requirements.</data>
      <data key="d8">AI governance,compliance,governance,information rights,innovation support,legal framework,legal obligation,output integrity,regulatory compliance,regulatory framework,risk classification,risk management,significance</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-5981afe4b9fb547c64f49e76b1d9c0a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee1f186f5aed070bc8e6e813caed9967&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ffd8df9d8eb9625dca23bc5f974e025&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e78bce1eaa5df9c186492b5e1482218&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-714d9f621f6eee9273625419653b083c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40e75ee11aa912f1497b2a91ae655e7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2315cd7abb88dee440f081de5430a32f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c664ec81872dda212b64d449aa7a2014&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7570653f66cb58454b80be2046705a29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-907dfa7ec80255255b81cd50cd6a4494&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b474f9815c7033ca1ad8daff4012eff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3105f8ed20ed5608a4571fe7b1d8f942</data>
