    <edge source="Regulation" target="high-risk AI systems">
      <data key="d6">54.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Regulation establishes critical conformity assessment procedures specifically for high-risk AI systems, which are highlighted within the text as having distinct compliance requirements. It mandates that providers of these high-risk AI systems adhere to specific obligations, promoting compliance even during transitional periods. Furthermore, the Regulation articulates the essential requirements and obligations that must be fulfilled by these providers to ensure the safe operation, effectiveness, and legal compliance of high-risk AI systems. This comprehensive framework is designed to enhance the safety and reliability of AI systems classified as high-risk.</data>
