    <edge source="Regulation" target="Commission">
      <data key="d6">124.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Commission is tasked with evaluating and reviewing the Regulation to ensure its relevance and effectiveness over time.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission plays a pivotal role in implementing and overseeing compliance with the Regulation governing artificial intelligence (AI) systems. This Regulation, which the Commission developed, specifically outlines the compliance process for small and medium-sized enterprises (SMEs) and AI providers, establishing a framework for managing high-risk AI systems. The Commission is responsible for enforcing the obligations set forth in the Regulation for AI model providers, ensuring they adhere to the established guidelines. Furthermore, the Commission oversees the notification requirements detailed in the Regulation and is tasked with the ongoing development and maintenance of these guidelines. It also issues directives that Member States must follow to effectively implement and enforce the provisions of the Regulation. The Commission remains proactive in updating the regulatory framework to align with the rapidly evolving landscape of AI technologies, thus ensuring that compliance measures are current and effective across Member States.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission's actions are guided by the Regulation that outlines its responsibilities regarding AI development.&lt;SEP&gt;The Regulation provides the framework under which the Commission operates to approve codes of practice.</data>
      <data key="d8">amendments,compliance,enforcement,governance,guidance,guideline creation,regulatory authority,regulatory body,regulatory compliance,regulatory framework,regulatory oversight</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-0c8a6b92fbe8d93eb878957c5ed60aa0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba662546e18e6e5f82c3cd1c5b4c3b75&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b235644744fa597c94328afbeaa7e56b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fa5fe9ac042448be58de6c82bb33ea4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdf8a675497acfbeb420b95621b7cb31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67ecee9ae9852fb675f5c9c9cb2f2de6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83f37d4143e19486af167d7acee5bee6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37d88f95110db00bbf8230a2632a2035&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-712b56cbfc73c46eacde9204fa4e5c49&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40e75ee11aa912f1497b2a91ae655e7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7365f713d09e74d49090cb78cb3e19b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae3ab8a3b5c5d0c61e8b99fa718913b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f892644f7a3eab6b024d8a386777f23</data>
