      <data key="d7">"Fundamental rights are central to the Regulation, ensuring that technology development adheres to ethical and legal standards.")&lt;SEP&gt;The Regulation aims to ensure that AI systems operate within the bounds of fundamental rights and democratic principles.&lt;SEP&gt;The Regulation aims to protect fundamental rights of individuals impacted by decisions from AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The Regulation aims to protect fundamental rights, ensuring individuals are safeguarded during the operation of AI systems.</data>
