      <data key="d7">The Board is part of the governance structure outlined in the Regulation, composed of representatives contributing to AI oversight.&lt;SEP&gt;The Board is tasked with monitoring the adherence to the Regulation and its requirements through the implementation of codes of practice.&lt;SEP&gt;The Board operates under the Regulation, ensuring that its tasks align with the established legal framework.&lt;SEP&gt;The Board specifies requests related to the Regulation, guiding the actions of the AI Office.&lt;SEP&gt;The Board's consultation is essential for the Commission in shaping the specifics of the Regulation regarding AI systems.</data>
