    <edge source="Regulation" target="AI Office">
      <data key="d6">94.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The AI Office is an entity established to oversee the development and implementation of guidelines and compliance measures related to the Regulation governing high-risk AI systems. Its primary responsibilities include creating guidelines to ensure that AI systems comply with the Regulation and maintaining AI classification standards to keep pace with technological advancements. The Regulation mandates the establishment of the AI Office to cultivate expertise and capabilities in artificial intelligence at the Union level, offering support to national authorities in applying AI regulatory frameworks.

In fulfilling its duties, the AI Office monitors activities as required by the Regulation concerning various AI models, ensuring that both providers and downstream users adhere to the established obligations regarding the use and documentation of these models. Furthermore, the AI Office is tasked with the classification and assessment of general-purpose AI models, overseeing the enforcement and compliance of the Regulation in this area. Overall, the AI Office plays a vital role in fostering a regulatory environment for artificial intelligence that aligns with public safety and ethical standards while facilitating understanding and compliance among operators.</data>
      <data key="d8">8,AI capabilities,compliance,compliance monitoring,enforcement,governance framework,implementation,legal framework,operational compliance,operational guidelines,operational support,oversight,regulatory compliance,regulatory enforcement,regulatory framework,regulatory oversight</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-6c9021d6cb53dceeddd1e648d3e37fbc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea1514e01d99729cb280141a24250142&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40a9e2a0fc4601f4b3d4f583384b6a06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af991f85166d6ddfbbf84e4a73207d3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-577494efd5ce842563e6974b0da9707b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c259012a2ff719418b0deb6cbd52130&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11bdaa862215570a86eed137e3092ea6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e3d60cf6cbe0ae91a9793cb5c98a4a92&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6579442a2f027e643cf907006333003a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e6a5cc59273abbe42c743808026477c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18d33fd192f06f727ac6bb21becbaa57</data>
