      <data key="d7">The Regulation is designed to be applicable across the Union, highlighting the geographical scope of its enforcement.&lt;SEP&gt;The Regulation is established by the Union to improve the internal market and protect rights related to AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The Union establishes the Regulation which governs how Conformity Assessment Bodies operate in Third Countries.&lt;SEP&gt;The regulation is established by the Union to govern the activities of conformity assessment bodies.&lt;SEP&gt;The Regulation is designed to uphold the values of the Union while ensuring the protection of its citizens and environment.</data>
