    <edge source="AI System" target="High-Risk AI System">
      <data key="d6">34.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The AI system can be categorized as a high-risk AI system based on its characteristics and the associated risks of misuse.&lt;SEP&gt;The classification of an AI system as high-risk is determined by its intended use and impact on natural persons, particularly in decision-making contexts.&lt;SEP&gt;The high-risk AI system is a specific category of AI system that requires compliance with additional regulations due to its potential impact."&lt;&lt;"risk management, compliance&lt;SEP&gt;The high-risk AI system is a specialized type of AI system that has additional requirements for functionality and data management.</data>
      <data key="d8">9,AI classification,categorization,classification,functional requirements,risk assessment</data>
