    <edge source="AI System" target="Market Surveillance Authority">
      <data key="d6">54.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Market Surveillance Authority is responsible for overseeing the implementation and compliance of AI systems within financial services. This authority ensures that such systems are regularly tested and monitored to comply with regulatory standards. In its role, the Market Surveillance Authority evaluates AI systems to assess their risk classification and ensures they do not pose any risks. Furthermore, the authority has the power to demand corrective actions from operators of AI systems and is authorized to impose measures, including the withdrawal of non-compliant AI systems from the market. Overall, the Market Surveillance Authority plays a crucial role in maintaining the integrity and safety of AI systems used within the financial sector.</data>
      <data key="d8">8,compliance,compliance oversight,enforcement,evaluation,regulation,regulatory authority,regulatory evaluation,regulatory oversight</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-a64bfb94635a0df2f808b2f8a494bd3e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ad9c740a10a5c1577e578a593bd61fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8da189e7622be67a80b2e12945a657cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cb2802f1b508b813d06e58ae27a1f77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb3519876fdebea487c9995e6d3ae4fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28daf57045ce50f0bd160cddd41ffc14</data>
