    <edge source="AI System" target="Provider">
      <data key="d6">70.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Providers oversee AI systems during testing, ensuring adherence to applicable regulations and standards.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI System Provider plays a crucial role in the development and marketing of AI systems or models. This provider is responsible for bringing the AI system to market and ensuring that it adheres to all regulatory compliance requirements. They must assess the AI system's risks and compliance with high-risk criteria as specified in regulatory guidelines before deployment or market placement. The provider is tasked with supplying AI systems that meet established regulatory standards and safety requirements, thereby ensuring that the systems are safe and compliant for use.&lt;SEP&gt;The Provider is responsible for the design, supply, and compliance of AI Systems with applicable regulations.</data>
      <data key="d8">compliance,compliance assessment,deployment responsibilities,development,market,oversight,provider responsibility,regulatory compliance,responsibility,supply,supply chain</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-a64bfb94635a0df2f808b2f8a494bd3e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f6e14583352886a741ac1d51eada03a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7d62750f1113d24ac155fcd2b2ef02c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2ba08954f9ed754c2566e3c59b63ee7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7dbd41da6ea2a77fff5beb18c8e7c896&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be61089eed18cfaf2703713378c589a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d64a2a65aec35f8304efaaee30e0034d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b4348ad8873ef2041aca94abc9297ee</data>
