    <edge source="AI System" target="Deployer">
      <data key="d6">32.0</data>
      <data key="d7">A deployer uses an AI system under its authority, highlighting its functional role.&lt;SEP&gt;Deployers are tasked with the implementation and operational management of AI systems according to the Regulation.&lt;SEP&gt;Deployers collaborate with Providers to conduct real-world testing of AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The deployer utilizes AI systems, which may have effects on individuals beyond just the deployer itself.</data>
