    <edge source="AI System" target="General-Purpose AI Model">
      <data key="d6">25.0</data>
      <data key="d7">An AI System incorporates a General-Purpose AI Model to execute tasks and processes efficiently.&lt;SEP&gt;General-purpose AI models are designed to power AI systems, which must comply with regulations depending on their risk classification.&lt;SEP&gt;General-purpose AI models are integrated into AI systems, linking their regulatory obligations directly to the systems they are part of.</data>
