    <edge source="High-Risk AI Systems" target="Compliance">
      <data key="d6">27.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Compliance is essential for the management and deployment of High-Risk AI Systems to mitigate associated risks.&lt;SEP&gt;High-Risk AI Systems must demonstrate Compliance to operate within the Union's regulated market.&lt;SEP&gt;Compliance measures are essential for High-Risk AI Systems to demonstrate adherence to regulations and protect users.</data>
