    <edge source="High-Risk AI Systems" target="Natural Persons">
      <data key="d6">26.0</data>
      <data key="d7">High-risk AI systems are classified based on their potential to affect natural persons' rights and access to services.&lt;SEP&gt;High-risk AI systems must inform natural persons when their decisions are being influenced by these systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Natural persons oversee high-risk AI systems to ensure they operate as intended and address impacts over their lifecycle.</data>
      <data key="d8">classification,informed consent,oversight role,regulatory compliance,responsibility,rights impact</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-ded7b0ac022304fae10651966b33d18c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b31c82fb046f107cbfab945a92431bbc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c1d05b847c03fe702172f787883fc33</data>
