    </edge>
    <edge source="High-Risk AI Systems" target="Creditworthiness Evaluation">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">High-risk AI systems are often used in the evaluation of creditworthiness, impacting access to financial resources.</data>
