      <data key="d7">High-Risk AI Systems are governed by Union Law that establishes rules for their use and governance to protect individual rights.&lt;SEP&gt;High-Risk AI Systems must adhere to Union Law requirements to ensure proper management and compliance with established regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;High-risk AI systems must comply with not only the CE marking but also additional requirements set by Union law, indicating broader regulatory implications.&lt;SEP&gt;Union law provides the framework for regulating high-risk AI systems to ensure the protection of fundamental rights.&lt;SEP&gt;High-Risk AI Systems are regulated under Union Law to ensure they do not threaten fundamental rights or safety.</data>
