      <data key="d7">The Market Surveillance Authority plays a critical role in overseeing the deployment and regulation of High-Risk AI Systems. It is responsible for monitoring and ensuring that these systems comply with established safety standards and regulations. This authority oversees the testing processes of high-risk AI systems, authorizing testing plans to guarantee that compliance is met throughout the testing phases. Overall, the Market Surveillance Authority ensures that the deployment of high-risk AI systems is conducted safely and in accordance with regulatory requirements.</data>
