    <edge source="EU Database" target="Commission">
      <data key="d6">56.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Commission functions as the primary controller and overseeing authority of the EU Database, which focuses on high-risk AI systems. It is tasked with managing and ensuring compliance within the database, which includes overseeing the registration processes and the enforcement of requirements related to high-risk AI systems. The Commission has exclusive access to restricted sections of the EU Database, allowing it to maintain proper governance and transparency. Through its roles, the Commission ensures that the database operates in accordance with established regulations, promoting accountability and safety within the realm of AI technologies.</data>
      <data key="d8">access control,data control,data governance,data management,database management,governance,oversight,regulatory authority,regulatory compliance,regulatory oversight</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-166a35f517674f4ceba2754c65f88c5f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18e4ea35b819263359794e3a968f44ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2806e288e0b71013209c4ad85ecaa38b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f116a95954c59b63ce3149e6283ed8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72498ec90c19419f10373dde7e7b51b3</data>
