    <edge source="Commission" target="National Competent Authorities">
      <data key="d6">33.0</data>
      <data key="d7">National Competent Authorities provide data and information to the Commission to assist in AI evaluations and compliance checks.&lt;SEP&gt;National competent authorities are accountable to the Commission for their activities and compliance with regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission oversees national competent authorities to ensure they are meeting the Regulation's requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission manages the electronic notification tool required for national competent authorities to communicate with Member States.</data>
