      <data key="d6">13.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Commission operates under a Five-Year Period for reviewing the extension of Delegated Acts.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission’s authority to adopt delegated acts is set for a five-year period, subject to review by the European Parliament and Council.</data>
      <data key="d8">governance,time frame,timeframe</data>
