    <edge source="Commission" target="Council">
      <data key="d6">41.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Commission reports its findings to the Council, indicating collaborative oversight of AI regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission reports on AI regulations to the Council, which participates in governance and decision-making regarding these regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission submits evaluations and proposals to the Council regarding the implementation of AI regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;The Council and the Commission work together in the EU governance framework, with the Council representing member states' interests and the Commission executing EU law."&lt;&lt;"governance cooperation, execution of law&lt;SEP&gt;The Council is another body to which the Commission reports about the evaluations and implications of the Regulation.</data>
