    <edge source="Commission" target="AI Office">
      <data key="d6">92.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The AI Office and the Commission collaborate closely to manage and update regulations concerning artificial intelligence (AI) within the Union. The Commission oversees the AI Office, which is responsible for monitoring the implementation of these regulations and investigating any potential infringements. To keep AI regulations current, the AI Office is empowered to request updates from the Commission. 

Furthermore, the AI Office plays an essential role in informing the Commission about qualified alerts and assisting in the evaluation of risks associated with AI models. The Commission is engaged in developing the AI Office to enhance AI capabilities within the Union and has charged it with the responsibility of remaining vigilant regarding general-purpose AI models that may present systemic risks. 

In addition to these functions, the Commission evaluates the effectiveness of the AI Office as part of its assessment of AI regulatory enforcement and examines the powers and resources available to the AI Office to ensure adequate enforcement of regulations. The AI Office is specifically tasked by the Commission with assisting in the implementation of the supervisory framework established under various regulatory articles, highlighting a direct supervisory relationship. Together, the AI Office and the Commission are committed to maintaining and improving the regulatory framework for AI technologies.</data>
      <data key="d8">capability enhancement,collaboration,development,empowerment,enforcement,evaluation,implementation,oversight,regulatory authority,regulatory compliance,regulatory enforcement,regulatory implementation,regulatory monitoring,regulatory oversight,regulatory updates,risk assessment,stakeholder communication,task delegation</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-21c742eff7a2b610bb01c8c0ec233b62&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea1514e01d99729cb280141a24250142&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b235644744fa597c94328afbeaa7e56b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af991f85166d6ddfbbf84e4a73207d3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23ab4f338bfa06297d4c996d7d54dc70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-140dff8b8263721e25ea86a4104c273d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b837dd750c95d041180fa3d735328672&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de5a0c7f560be7dcbe4301aed20bcb98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ec7c9ce58b650afe456517c2483e56c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f892644f7a3eab6b024d8a386777f23</data>
