    <edge source="Commission" target="AI Regulatory Sandboxes">
      <data key="d6">17.0</data>
      <data key="d7">AI Regulatory Sandboxes facilitate testing of AI technologies under the Commission's supervision to ensure regulatory compliance.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission establishes the regulations and processes governing AI regulatory sandboxes, ensuring coherence across the Union.</data>
