    <edge source="Commission" target="Notifying Authority">
      <data key="d6">16.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Commission works with notifying authorities to ensure that bodies involved comply with high-risk AI assessments.&lt;SEP&gt;The notifying authority informs the Commission about the status of notified bodies and any required actions regarding compliance.</data>
