    <edge source="Commission" target="Notified Body">
      <data key="d6">34.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Commission assigns identification numbers to notified bodies, ensuring they are recognized within regulatory frameworks.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission investigates and evaluates the competence of the notified body to ensure compliance with requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;The Notified Body reports to the Commission on certifications and compliance results for AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The notified body must inform the Commission of any relevant changes in its activities to ensure compliance with regulations.</data>
      <data key="d8">compliance,oversight,regulatory compliance,regulatory oversight,reporting</data>
