    <edge source="Commission" target="National Measure">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Commission evaluates whether the National Measure taken by a Member State is justified or unjustified based on compliance with AI regulations.</data>
      <data key="d8">compliance assessment,regulatory evaluation</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-ee6d94a5f64203f09d02387acbdb39c5</data>
      <data key="d10">./cached_docs/article_81.json</data>
      <data key="d11">1750859264</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Commission" target="Harmonised Standards">
      <data key="d6">48.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Commission plays a crucial role in the development, assessment, and implementation of Harmonised Standards designed to facilitate compliance with AI regulations. These standards are proposed by the Commission to aid in the enforcement of the AI Regulation and are subject to thorough evaluation. Before any harmonised standards can be published, the Commission assesses and approves them, ensuring they meet the necessary criteria for AI compliance. 

In its review process, the Commission also considers any shortcomings in these standards when evaluating AI systems to ensure they adhere to regulatory requirements. The Commission is actively involved in both the adoption and proposal phases of harmonised standards, continuously monitoring their implementation to support compliance. Overall, the Commission’s efforts are focused on addressing regulatory requirements and fundamental concerns associated with AI technologies through the development and enforcement of these standards.</data>
      <data key="d8">compliance,regulatory compliance,regulatory framework,regulatory process,specification development,standard approval,standardization,standards adoption,standards development,standards evaluation</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-ee6d94a5f64203f09d02387acbdb39c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-010f171cc1a7f217689efe00fd8cb656&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f41337092de45470ab838aff17309ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6fc829d58f1a7bbf3defd5cbe758b8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b837dd750c95d041180fa3d735328672&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de5a0c7f560be7dcbe4301aed20bcb98</data>
      <data key="d10">./cached_docs/article_81.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_121.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_112.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_41.json</data>
      <data key="d11">1750863588</data>
    </edge>
