      <data key="d6">17.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Article 5 outlines the prohibition of AI practices that the Commission assesses and may amend annually.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission refers to Article 5 when assessing the prohibition of AI practices and the subsequent actions required from Member States.</data>
