      <data key="d7">Regulation (EU) No 1025/2012 empowers the Commission to assess and publish harmonised standards to ensure compliance with safety and technical requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission applies procedures outlined in Regulation (EU) No 1025/2012 for justified national measures concerning AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission oversees the implementation and assessment of Regulation (EU) No 1025/2012 regarding AI systems.</data>
