      <data key="d7">AI regulatory sandboxes are deployed and overseen by National Competent Authorities, ensuring compliance and safety during AI system testing.&lt;SEP&gt;National Competent Authorities supervise the operations of AI Regulatory Sandboxes to ensure compliance with regulations and promote innovation in AI development.&lt;SEP&gt;National Competent Authorities oversee the establishment and functionality of AI Regulatory Sandboxes to ensure they comply with local laws.&lt;SEP&gt;National competent authorities are the entities responsible for establishing and operating AI regulatory sandboxes, directing their implementation and oversight.&lt;SEP&gt;National competent authorities implement and supervise the operation of AI regulatory sandboxes, ensuring participants adhere to the established rules.</data>
      <data key="d8">administrative oversight,deployment,governance,innovation,local governance,regulatory compliance,regulatory framework,regulatory oversight</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-aca56f82b70892874784bcec5c2bb2c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95424b9dff57302628c496570b4baff4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d08b537f9a5bb2b4f4bbdf442ba39bdd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc97d8ad7f3aa0522d885f92ee323822&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34333cde7ca701413cb4d0a0ef1129e1</data>
