    </edge>
    <edge source="National Competent Authorities" target="AI Regulatory Sandbox">
      <data key="d6">52.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The AI Regulatory Sandbox is a controlled environment designed for the testing and development of artificial intelligence systems under regulated conditions. Oversight of this sandbox is the responsibility of National Competent Authorities, which are tasked by Member States with the establishment, management, and regulation of these sandboxes. The National Competent Authorities ensure that the operations of the AI regulatory sandbox comply with national laws and safety standards, safeguarding the compliance and security of the AI systems being tested. Through their supervision, they aim to facilitate innovation in AI while maintaining adherence to relevant regulations and addressing safety concerns during experimentation.</data>
      <data key="d8">compliance,oversight,regulatory framework,regulatory implementation,regulatory oversight,sandbox management</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-7859a0c655f74761757b416c3b50bf36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85bb41c1db2d2e1883172e505d5f7b71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4cdf1c7e7ad7fe2c6b1b8f1b0b12db35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-184360d53ae652d7f48a919e168f375a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6adb64ff4e7b459fa1df815eac98b096</data>
