    <edge source="Market Surveillance Authority" target="Regulation (EU) 2019/1020">
      <data key="d6">55.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Market Surveillance Authority operates under the legal framework established by Regulation (EU) 2019/1020, which is designed to ensure compliance of AI systems and various products within the EU. This authority is tasked with managing complaints and conducting market surveillance to uphold regulatory standards. It functions according to the mandates and guidelines set forth by Regulation (EU) 2019/1020, which includes assessing and responding to notifications of serious incidents. Through its operations, the Market Surveillance Authority plays a crucial role in ensuring that products and AI systems conform to EU regulations, thereby protecting consumers and maintaining market integrity.</data>
      <data key="d8">authority mandate,authority operations,compliance,compliance framework,enforcement,legal framework,regulatory authority,regulatory compliance,regulatory framework,regulatory oversight</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-43e82a7af456b2ae813a7217f92c2008&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c27775e23d04f7dd6b8ec477a62efd1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0779dfb4a5c0f82f05a67985fe0224a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ad9c740a10a5c1577e578a593bd61fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28daf57045ce50f0bd160cddd41ffc14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-610573a7c194ad780ed97782200a740c</data>
      <data key="d10">./cached_docs/article_85.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_80.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_79.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_3.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_73.json</data>
      <data key="d11">1750863843</data>
    </edge>
