    <edge source="General-Purpose AI Models" target="Codes of Practice">
      <data key="d6">50.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Codes of Practice are essential guidelines that help ensure compliance for providers of general-purpose AI models with their regulatory obligations. These codes serve to mitigate systemic risks inherent in the deployment of such AI technologies. Providers of general-purpose AI models are encouraged to adhere to the codes of practice established by the AI Office. By doing so, they can fulfill their regulatory requirements effectively. The overarching aim of these codes is to ensure that all providers of general-purpose AI models consistently follow established obligations and practices, thereby promoting accountability and safety in the use of AI. Compliance with these codes is vital for regulatory adherence and the responsible development of AI technologies.</data>
      <data key="d8">AI development,application,compliance,compliance requirement,documentation,ethical standards,guidelines,regulatory compliance,standards</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-f6de18717bcb0167956be85a15dd210f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c8a6b92fbe8d93eb878957c5ed60aa0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cfbca03bf6afb99c3326dc8b02d083b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4dc0271c68856282748506ff58069b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18d33fd192f06f727ac6bb21becbaa57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-daa2a9a43bd7a2482ad876b406b9e9c3</data>
      <data key="d10">./cached_docs/article_56.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_55.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_89.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_117.json</data>
      <data key="d11">1750863528</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="General-Purpose AI Models" target="AI Office">
      <data key="d6">77.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The AI Office is tasked with monitoring the obligations of providers of general-purpose AI models regarding copyright compliance.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI Office mandates that providers submit documentation regarding general-purpose AI models for verification and compliance.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI Office plays a crucial role in overseeing the implementation of regulations pertaining to General-Purpose AI Models. Its primary responsibilities include monitoring compliance and ensuring that providers of these AI models adhere to established codes of practice. To fulfill its mandate, the AI Office oversees compliance and documentation related to systemic risks associated with general-purpose AI models and addresses any identified risks through effective governance structures.

Additionally, the AI Office is tasked with enforcing regulations applicable to these models, which involves investigating any infringements and ensuring that all entities comply with the relevant regulations. Through these efforts, the AI Office aims to promote regulatory compliance and safeguard against potential risks linked to general-purpose AI models.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI Office provides templates and guidelines for the transparent documentation of general-purpose AI models' training data.</data>
      <data key="d8">AI oversight,compliance,compliance enforcement,compliance monitoring,compliance oversight,governance,model compliance,oversight,provider engagement,regulatory compliance,regulatory enforcement,regulatory guidance,regulatory oversight,regulatory responsibility,transparency</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-af991f85166d6ddfbbf84e4a73207d3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4dc89de2edca5d2bfe0d5e9e7c99665b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32556db3a80f72f1db354810bba21be7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c4d08c48923bc3e8bff8968fd67a799&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-daa2a9a43bd7a2482ad876b406b9e9c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a0c1908573a7d6a832a6b35befbd7ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18d33fd192f06f727ac6bb21becbaa57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cfbca03bf6afb99c3326dc8b02d083b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fcd3af92cad1d85ebf561f059acb114</data>
      <data key="d10">./cached_docs/recital_107.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_56.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_164.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_163.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_162.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_55.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_89.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_53.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_108.json</data>
      <data key="d11">1750863612</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="General-Purpose AI Models" target="Systemic Risks">
      <data key="d6">19.0</data>
      <data key="d7">General-purpose AI models are associated with systemic risks due to their potential impact across multiple sectors and societal issues.&lt;SEP&gt;The adherence to codes of practice by general-purpose AI models aims to mitigate systemic risks associated with their deployment.</data>
