      <data key="d7">An open-source license applies to general-purpose AI models enabling unrestricted access and modification, barring systemic risks.&lt;SEP&gt;General-purpose AI models are made available under an open-source license, promoting their public availability and transparency.&lt;SEP&gt;General-purpose AI models are often distributed under open-source licenses to facilitate wider access and innovation in AI technology."&lt;&lt;"accessibility, innovation</data>
