    <edge source="European Parliament" target="Regulation (EU) 2024/1689">
      <data key="d6">51.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The European Parliament is a key legislative body involved in the formulation, approval, and adoption of Regulation (EU) 2024/1689, which pertains to the regulation of artificial intelligence (AI) systems. This regulation is crucial for establishing a legal framework surrounding AI technologies and ensuring their safe implementation. The European Parliament's role encompasses not only legislative approval but also active participation in the proposal and development stages of the regulation. By influencing the legislative process, the European Parliament significantly impacts the governance of AI safety and related standards within the European Union.</data>
