    <edge source="High-Risk AI System" target="Deployers">
      <data key="d6">26.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Deployers are responsible for implementing High-Risk AI Systems according to the required standards laid out.&lt;SEP&gt;Deployers are responsible for the implementation and proper usage of the High-Risk AI System in various applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Deployers are responsible for informing and complying with regulations associated with high-risk AI systems they wish to implement in workplaces.</data>
      <data key="d8">compliance,implementation,implementation responsibility,regulatory compliance,responsibility</data>
