      <data key="d11">1750863045</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="High-Risk AI System" target="Distributor">
      <data key="d6">25.0</data>
      <data key="d7">A distributor is considered a provider of high-risk AI systems if they put their trademark on the system and assume relevant obligations for compliance.&lt;SEP&gt;Distributors are considered providers once they put their name on a high-risk AI system, thus they are legally accountable.&lt;SEP&gt;Distributors are responsible for ensuring that high-risk AI systems comply with legal requirements before making them available on the market.</data>
      <data key="d8">market responsibility,obligations,provider obligations,regulatory compliance</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-b4329be6d4972c392a3a71593d402998&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a8bd64d122f5a09e9e3859bf77c6931&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73fd7e801c2d8d41361f6b16b45c6ed0</data>
      <data key="d10">./cached_docs/article_25.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_24.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_84.json</data>
      <data key="d11">1750861101</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="High-Risk AI System" target="Importer">
      <data key="d6">32.0</data>
      <data key="d7">An importer assumes obligations as a provider when they bring high-risk AI systems into the market.&lt;SEP&gt;Importers are subject to the same obligations as distributors when dealing with high-risk AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Importers share the responsibility with providers and distributors for ensuring that the high-risk AI systems meet compliance requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;The importer must ensure that the high-risk AI system complies with all relevant regulations to facilitate its market entry.".</data>
      <data key="d8">compliance,market introduction,obligations,provider obligations,regulatory compliance,regulatory oversight,supply chain responsibility</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-6a8bd64d122f5a09e9e3859bf77c6931&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4329be6d4972c392a3a71593d402998&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a21678b36bef336bf18e091bdfdb68f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73fd7e801c2d8d41361f6b16b45c6ed0</data>
      <data key="d10">./cached_docs/article_25.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_24.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_84.json</data>
      <data key="d11">1750861101</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="High-Risk AI System" target="Deployer">
      <data key="d6">25.0</data>
      <data key="d7">A deployer places high-risk AI systems into service, assuming responsibility for compliance with regulatory requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;Deployers are included in the category of providers of high-risk AI systems under regulatory definitions.&lt;SEP&gt;The deployer must conduct an impact assessment before deploying high-risk AI systems to ensure compliance with rights protection.</data>
      <data key="d8">assessment process,compliance,obligations,provider obligations,regulatory compliance,responsibility</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-ee04f6104a24650416810ede28f3790b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4329be6d4972c392a3a71593d402998&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a8bd64d122f5a09e9e3859bf77c6931</data>
      <data key="d10">./cached_docs/article_25.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_84.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_96.json</data>
      <data key="d11">1750858143</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="High-Risk AI System" target="Product Manufacturer">
      <data key="d6">18.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Product manufacturers become providers of high-risk AI systems when these systems are associated with their products.&lt;SEP&gt;The product manufacturer is obligated to ensure that the high-risk AI system meets safety and regulatory requirements.</data>
      <data key="d8">compliance,obligations,product integration,provider obligations</data>
