    <edge source="AI Office" target="Codes of Practice">
      <data key="d6">48.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The AI Office plays a crucial role in the formulation and implementation of Codes of Practice aimed at ensuring compliance with AI regulations. It is tasked with the responsibility of facilitating the creation of these codes to help effectively apply the Regulation. The AI Office ensures that the codes of practice include appropriate commitments and objectives for all participants involved in the use and development of AI technologies. 

In particular, the office is focused on facilitating the adoption of codes specifically tailored for general-purpose AI model providers. Additionally, the AI Office promotes the development of these codes to assist with content labeling and transparency obligations, thereby ensuring that providers can demonstrate adherence to regulatory requirements. Overall, the Codes of Practice, developed by the AI Office, serve as a vital framework guiding AI providers in their efforts to comply with the Regulation.</data>
      <data key="d8">code adoption,compliance,compliance support,guidance,guidelines,implementation,regulatory body,regulatory framework,regulatory oversight,standards development</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-f6de18717bcb0167956be85a15dd210f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50cb89ed7d0d818018d373ebefa65267&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40a9e2a0fc4601f4b3d4f583384b6a06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4dc0271c68856282748506ff58069b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-daa2a9a43bd7a2482ad876b406b9e9c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0373d38f7600f51def3b5e5cb5061d17</data>
