      <data key="d6">16.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The AI Office encourages the review of codes of practice in light of emerging standards to ensure ongoing relevance.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI Office plays a role in encouraging the development of emerging standards in light of new AI practices.</data>
      <data key="d8">adaptation,regulatory adaptation,standard development,standardization</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-f6de18717bcb0167956be85a15dd210f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-daa2a9a43bd7a2482ad876b406b9e9c3</data>
