    <edge source="AI Office" target="General-Purpose AI Model">
      <data key="d6">67.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The AI Office engages with the provider of the General-Purpose AI Model to discuss internal testing and risk mitigations.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI Office evaluates the general-purpose AI model to ensure compliance with regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI Office plays a crucial role in the regulation and oversight of general-purpose AI models. It is tasked with assessing and managing the systematic risks associated with these models. To ensure compliance with regulatory standards, the AI Office engages in structured dialogues with providers of general-purpose AI models, discussing important matters related to compliance and oversight.

In addition to monitoring these AI models for adherence to compliance standards, the AI Office also provides guidelines on the summary requirements for the training content of general-purpose AI models. This ensures that the training processes align with established regulations. Furthermore, the AI Office is responsible for reviewing and classifying models that may pose systemic risks, thereby maintaining a safe and responsible AI landscape.</data>
      <data key="d8">AI management,compliance,compliance assistance,compliance oversight,dialogue,engagement,evaluation,monitoring,oversight,regulation,regulatory compliance,regulatory oversight,risk management,transparency</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-23ab4f338bfa06297d4c996d7d54dc70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90efb8f063f236753e4794005afa2a0d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c553a0db4b39033e7fcfeddeb912aac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-075ecb5835777e6044264a23ca0cb20a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c49e78c25e30ed3a2557915010f14f3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fb0ee5d200ca5b71eb6d9f53ad070ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ec7c9ce58b650afe456517c2483e56c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b567607dbb431b0d294cd02679760039</data>
      <data key="d10">./cached_docs/recital_113.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_91.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_112.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_54.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_92.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_111.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_53.json</data>
      <data key="d11">1750863869</data>
    </edge>
