    <edge source="General-Purpose AI Model" target="Systemic Risk">
      <data key="d6">46.0</data>
      <data key="d7">A General-Purpose AI Model is classified as having Systemic Risk when it meets high impact capability conditions as evaluated by the Commission.&lt;SEP&gt;The general-purpose AI model has a potential for systemic risk due to its widespread usage and capabilities.&lt;SEP&gt;The general-purpose AI model is acknowledged for its systemic risks that warrant reassessment by the Commission.&lt;SEP&gt;The designation of a General-Purpose AI Model is specifically related to its systemic risks.&lt;SEP&gt;General-Purpose AI Models can carry Systemic Risks that necessitate classification and monitoring by regulatory bodies.</data>
      <data key="d8">AI classification,AI oversight,model classification,model evaluation,model impact,risk assessment,risk association,risk management</data>
