    <edge source="General-Purpose AI Model" target="Free and Open-Source License">
      <data key="d6">31.0</data>
      <data key="d7">General-purpose AI models can be exempt from obligations if they are released under a free and open-source license.&lt;SEP&gt;General-purpose AI models released under a free and open-source license do not require the appointment of an authorised representative unless systemic risks are present.&lt;SEP&gt;Models released under a free and open-source license are exempt from certain regulatory obligations unless they present systemic risks.&lt;SEP&gt;Models released under a free and open-source license are exempt from certain obligations that apply to general-purpose AI models."&lt;&lt;"licensing exemption, compliance</data>
