    <edge source="Regulation (EU) 2024/1689" target="Artificial Intelligence systems">
      <data key="d6">36.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Artificial Intelligence systems are covered under Regulation (EU) 2024/1689, which sets standardized rules for their implementation and safety.&lt;SEP&gt;Artificial Intelligence systems are defined and governed under Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 regarding safety components.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 provides a framework that governs the deployment and regulatory requirements for AI systems, emphasizing safety components.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 establishes requirements specifically for Artificial Intelligence systems classified as safety components.</data>
      <data key="d8">AI governance,AI safety,AI systems compliance,regulation,regulatory compliance,regulatory standards,safety standards</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-c472ba24566e25512f738275d98a9e3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4219a2a10d85ddd82f98b8d6267cb9b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3acb107043f5850a72cf1b047a443296&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0b46b9cdd1723562953df9638581250</data>
      <data key="d10">./cached_docs/article_106.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_108.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_105.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_107.json</data>
      <data key="d11">1750862700</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Regulation (EU) 2024/1689" target="Artificial Intelligence Systems">
      <data key="d6">46.0</data>
      <data key="d7">"The requirements regarding artificial intelligence systems in Regulation (EU) No 168/2013 will be reevaluated under Regulation (EU) 2024/1689."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;Artificial Intelligence Systems must adhere to the rules established in Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 regarding safety and compliance.&lt;SEP&gt;Artificial Intelligence systems are covered under Regulation (EU) 2024/1689, which sets standardized rules for their implementation and safety.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 includes provisions that apply to artificial intelligence systems as safety components.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 establishes rules governing the use and approval of AI systems.</data>
      <data key="d8">AI governance,AI systems,AI systems compliance,compliance,regulatory compliance,regulatory evolution,regulatory standards,safety regulation,safety standards</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-e0b46b9cdd1723562953df9638581250&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a84d660603389dd91dcd96134d5bb46e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a5a3ae528d10c9d38e017d520ab6719&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7eb5283f4e280f1ec77650d624699286&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3acb107043f5850a72cf1b047a443296</data>
      <data key="d10">./cached_docs/article_102.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_106.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_103.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_104.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_105.json</data>
      <data key="d11">1750863887</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Regulation (EU) 2024/1689" target="Chapter III, Section 2">
      <data key="d6">49.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Chapter III, Section 2 of Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 delineates the comprehensive requirements for artificial intelligence (AI) systems concerning their regulatory approval. This section specifies the essential criteria that are necessary for the implementation of safety components within AI systems and identifies the requirements for AI systems that are recognized as safety components. Additionally, it outlines key considerations to be addressed in the delegated acts related to AI systems, as established under this regulation. Importantly, Chapter III, Section 2 provides specific requirements that are pertinent to the implementing acts under Regulation (EU) 2019/2144, ensuring a coherent regulatory framework for AI systems. Overall, this section serves as a foundational element within the AI regulatory framework, detailing the obligations necessary for compliance and safety in AI implementations.</data>
      <data key="d8">AI compliance,AI governance,compliance requirements,documentation requirement,legal prerequisite,regulation specifics,regulatory compliance,regulatory requirements,requirements outline,safety guidelines,specific provisions</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-a4219a2a10d85ddd82f98b8d6267cb9b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0b46b9cdd1723562953df9638581250&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a84d660603389dd91dcd96134d5bb46e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a5a3ae528d10c9d38e017d520ab6719&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9e2499910b26136c66e6e7a013d8f0b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c472ba24566e25512f738275d98a9e3b</data>
      <data key="d10">./cached_docs/article_109.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_102.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_106.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_103.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_107.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_108.json</data>
      <data key="d11">1750862980</data>
    </edge>
