      <data key="d7">Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 establishes Harmonised Rules that standardize safety requirements for AI across EU member states.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 provides harmonised rules that standardise AI systems' operational and safety requirements.</data>
